<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">Meitei: Roman Script 1st Translation</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">John</para>
  <para style="toc1">JOHN-NA I-ba Aphaba Pao</para>
  <para style="toc2">John</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jn</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOHN-NA</para>
  <para style="mt2">I-ba Aphaba Pao</para>
  <para style="imt1">Wahoudok</para>
  <para style="ip">John-na i-ba Aphaba Pao asi Jisu Christtagi punsigi maramda sandokna takpa Anouba Warepnaba-gi lairik mari adugi manungda amani. Lairik marimak adu “Gospel” haina kou-i, madugi wahanthokti “Aphaba Pao” haibani. Lairiksing adu Jisuna sikhraba matungda Matthew, Mark, Luk amadi John-na ibani. John-na i-ba Aphaba Pao asi Christtana poklaba matung chahi 90 mukki aduwaida Pakhonchatpa John-na iramba yai. John-na i-bani haina Lairik asida pandrabasu 1 John, 2 John amadi 3 John-gi chithising asida iribagi mawong- matouga yamna manei. Mamangngeigi ayiba kharana haibagi matung inna matam aduda mahak Ephesus-ta leirammi, maram aduna lairik asi Ephesus-ta leiringeida iramba yai. Jisudi ahingba Mapu Ibungogi Machanupa amadi Christta aduni haiba misingna thajabada mateng oinaba ibani haina John-na sengna hairi (20:31). Masi thajabagi mapanna Ibungo mahakki mingda eikhoina hingba phangjanabani. Lairik asi Jihudising amadi Jihudi nattabasing animakna panaba ibani. John-na i-ba Aphaba Pao asidi atoppa Aphaba Pao ahum adudagi khara makheidi khennei. Lairik asidi Jisuna toukhiba angakpa thabaksing aduda mityeng thammi aduga Ibungona haiba pandamsing adu yamna i-de. Atei maru oiba thoudok khara haibadi Jisuna baptize louba aduga leikanglagi maphamda athemba thengnakhiba adugi matangda Aphaba Pao asida ide.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaopham Takpa</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Aphaba Pao asigi wahoudok <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Jisuna pangthokkhiba angakpa thabak kharagi maramda i-ba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 1:19-12:50">1:19–12:50</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Jisuna siba amadi hinggatkadaba mang-oinana Jisugi punsida thokkhiba thoudok kayagi maramda sandokna takpa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 13:1-20:31">13:1–20:31</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Tangkak 21 da Jisuna sibadagi hinggatlaba matungda misingda uhanbibagi maramda i-ba amadi lairik asi ibagi maram taklaga Aphaba Pao asi losilli <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21:1-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Hingbagi wahei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Ahoubada Wahei adu leirammi; Wahei adu Tengban Mapuga leiminnarammi amasung Wahei adu Tengban Mapu oirammi. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Hek houba adudagi houna Wahei adu Tengban Mapuga leiminnarammi. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Ibungo mahakki mapanna Tengban Mapuna pot pumnamak sembikhi; Ibungo mahak yaodana semkhiba khutsem amata leite. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Ibungoda hingba leirammi aduga hingba aduna misinggi mangal oirammi. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Mangal aduna amambada ngalle aduga amamba aduna mangal adubu ngamde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">khangba nattraga wakhal taba ngamde</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:1">Mat 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mrk 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1">Luk 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>Tengban Mapuna thabirakpa John kouba mi ama leirammi. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Mi khudingmak mahakki mapanna thajaraknaba, mahakna misingda mangal adugi maramda hainaba lakpani. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Mahak masamakti mangal adu natte adubu mahakti mangal adugi maramda hainanaba lakpani. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Mi khudingmakta mangal pibiba achumba mangal adu taibangpanda laklammi.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Wahei adu taibangpanda leirammi, aduga Mapu Ibungona taibangpan asi Ibungo mahakki mapanna sembikhiba oirabasu, taibangpannadi Ibungo mahakpu khanglamde. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Ibungo mahakna masagi oiba maphamda laklammi adubu mahakmakki misingna Ibungobu lousillamde. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Adubu mi kharanadi Ibungobu lousinjarammi amadi Ibungobu thajarammi; maram aduna Ibungona makhoida Tengban Mapugi machasing oinaba matik pibire. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Makhoina Tengban Mapugi machasing oirakpa asi mama mapana nattraga mioibagi apambana nattraga mapuroibagi warepna pokpiba adugumba natte adubu Mapu Ibungona pokpibani.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Wahei aduna sayollaktuna thoujal amadi achumbana pik thanduna eikhoigi irakta leibirare. Aduga eikhoina Ibungo mahakki matik mangal haibadi Mapagi amatta ngairaba Macha oibagi matik mangal adu ujare.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>John-na Ibungo mahakki maramda hairammi. Mahakna houna hairak-i, “‘Ibungona eigi tungda lengbirakli adubu Ibungo mahakti eina poktringeida hannana leirabani maram asina Ibungona eingondagi henna chao-i,’ haina eina nakhoida haikhiba Ibungo mahak adu asini.”<verse eid="JHN 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Athanba thoujalgi pukkei oiriba Ibungo mangondagi yaipha thoujal amagi mathakta yaipha thoujal ama eikhoi pumnamakna phangjare. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Wayel Yathangdi Moses-ki mapanna pibibani adubu thoujal amasung achumbadi Jisu Christtagi mapanna lakpani. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Mi kana amatana Tengban Mapubu kheidounungdasu ukhidri. Adubu Mapaga yamna naknana leiriba amatta ngairaba Machanupa Mapu Ibungona Ibungo mahakpu phongdokle.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baptize toubiba John-gi pao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mrk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Jerusalem-da leiba Jihudisingna, John-bu kanano haina hangnaba purohitsing amasung Levi-singbu John-gi manakta tharaklammi.<verse eid="JHN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Mahakna paokhum piningdaba touramde aduga i-phong phongna sengna hairak-i, “Eidi Christta adu natte.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Aniwa 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 48:10">Isei 48:10</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 48:11">11</ref></char>
    </note>Maduda makhoina hanglak-i, “Adu oirabadi nahak kanano? Nahak Elijah-ra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">John-na khumlak-i, “Ei natte.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Adudagi makhoina hanglak-i, “Adudi Mapu Ibungogi wa phongdokpa maichou ama lakkani haibadu nahakla?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Mahakna khumlak-i, “Natte”<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Aroibada makhoina hairak-i, “Adu oirabadi nahak kanano haibasi eikhoida haibirak-u. Eikhoibu tharakpa makhoising aduda tamlunaba nahakna paokhum amadi pibiyu. Nahakna nasagi maramda kari haijabage?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Mapu Ibungogi wa phongdokpa maichou Isaiah-gi waheising sijinnaduna John-na paokhum pirak-i:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Lamjao lamhangda laoriba kanagumba amagi khonjel adu eini:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">‘MAPU IBUNGO<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jehova</char></note> mahakna chatnanaba lambi adu chumhallu!’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Pharisee kharasu John-gi maphamda tharak-i, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>makhoina John-da hanglak-i, “Nahak Christta adusu Elijah adusu Mapu Ibungogi wa phongdokpa maichou adusu nattrabadi karigi nahakna baptize touribano?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Maduda John-na khumlak-i, “Einadi isingda baptize tou-i adubu nakhoina khangdaba kanagumba ama nakhoigi narakta lepli. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Ibungo mahakna eigi tungda lakli aduga eidi Ibungo mahakki sandal mari louthokpa phaoba matik chade.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>John-na baptize toubiba mapham Jordan turen-gi nongpok thangba wangmada leiba Bethany-da masigi thoudok asi thokkhibani.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tengban Mapugi Yaomacha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Mathanggi numitta Jisuna John-gi manakta lakpadu ure maduda John-na hairak-i, “Yeng-u, taibangpanbagi pappu pubiduna louthokpiba Tengban Mapugi Yaomacha adu! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Ibungo asigi maramdani eina haikhibadu, ‘Kanagumba ama eigi tungda lengbirakli, Ibungo mahakti eina poktringeidagi hannana leirabani maramsina Ibungona eingondagi henna chao-i.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Einadi Ibungobu kanano haiba khanglamde adubu eina isingda baptize toubasi Ibungo mahakpu Israel-da phongdoknabani.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Adudagi John-na sakhi asi pirammi: “Thawai aduna swargadagi khunugumna lengtharaktuna Ibungoda leiba adu eina ure. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Eibu isingda baptize tounaba thabiba Ibungo mahakna eingonda, ‘Thawai aduna kanagumba amagi mathakta lengtharaktuna leiba nahakna ugani; mahak aduna Thawai Asengbada baptize toubigani,’ haina haibiramdrabadi eina Ibungo mahakpu khanglamloidabani. <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Eina madumak ujare aduga Ibungo mahak asi Tengban Mapugi Machanupani haina eina nakhoida hairi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisugi ahanba tung-inbasing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Mathanggi numitta John-na mahakki tung-inba aniga loinana leptuna leirammi. <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Jisuna mapham aduda chatpadu ubada mahakna hairak-i, “Yeng-u, Tengban Mapugi Yaomacha adu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>John-na haiba adu mahakki tung-inba aniduna tarabada makhoina Jisugi matung induna chatkhirammi. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Jisuna leithorakpada makhoina mahakki tung illakliba adu ure maduda Ibungona hanglak-i, “Nakhoi kari pambage?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Maduda makhoina khumlak-i, “Rabbi” (Masigi wahanthokti “Oja Ibungo” haibani), “Ibungo nahak kadaida leibibage?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Ibungona khumlak-i, “Lak-u aduga nakhoina u-gani.” (Matam adu numit yungba matung pung marimuk tabada oirammi.) Maram aduna makhoina Ibungoga loinana chattuna Ibungona leiba mapham adu ujare aduga numit aduma makhoina Ibungoga loinana leiminnarammi.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>John-na haiba adu taduna Jisugi tung inkhiba makhoi anigi marakta amadi Simon Peter-gi manao Andrew-ni. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Andrew-na ihan hanna mahakki mayamba Simon-bu thiraga mangonda hairammi, “Eikhoina Messiah adu phangjare.” (Madudi “Christta” haibani) <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Adudagi mahakna Simon-bu Jisugi manakta purakle.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Jisuna Simon-da yenglaga hairak-i, “Nahakti John-gi machanupa Simon-ni, adubu nahakki naming Cephas kougani.” (Masigi wahanthokti “Peter”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peter haibadi “Nung” haibani </char></note> haibani.)<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Philip amadi Nathanael-bu kouba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Mathanggi numitta Galilee-da Jisuna chatke leple. Ibungona Philip-pu thengnarabada mangonda hairak-i, “Eigi itung illak-u!” <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>(Andrew amadi Peter-gumna Philip-su Bethsaida sahardagini.) <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Philip-na Nathanael-bu phanglabada mangonda hairammi, “Moses-na Wayel Yathangda amasung Mapu Ibungogi wa phongdokpa maichousingnasu ibiramba mahak adu eikhoina phangle. Mahak adudi Joseph-ki machanupa, Nazareth-ki Jisuni.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Nathanael-na hanglak-i, “Nazareth-tagibu karigumba aphaba thorakpa ngambra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Maduda Philip-na khumlak-i, “Laktuna yeng-u.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Mahakki manakta Nathanael-na lakpadu urabada Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Mapham asida tasengba Israel-gi mi ama leire; mangonda lounamba leite.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Nathanael-na Ibungoda hanglak-i, “Ibungona eibu karamna khangbibage?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Maduda Jisuna paokhum pirak-i, “Philip-na nahakpu koudringeida, nahakna heiyit pambi makhada leiba matam aduda eina nangbu ure.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Nathanael-na khumlak-i, “Oja Ibungo, nahak Tengban Mapugi Machanupa aduni! Nahak Israel-gi Ningthouni!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Nahakna heiyit pambi makhada leiringeida eina nangbu ure haina eina nangonda haibagi maramna nahakna thajaribra? Masidagi henna chaoba thabaksing nahakna ukhigani.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Meihou 28:12</ref></char></note>Adudagi Ibungona makha tarak-i, “Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairiba asini, swarga hangdokpa amadi Tengban Mapugi dutsingna Migi Machanupa adugi mathakta kakhat khumtha touba adu nakhoina ugani.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Cana kouba khunda luhongba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Numit ninigi matungda Galilee-gi Cana kouba khun aduda luhongba ama leirammi. Jisugi mamasu maduda yaorammi, <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>aduga Jisu amadi mahakki tung-inbasingsu luhongba adu yaobinanaba haijaraklammi. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Anggur mahi loikhrabada Jisugi mamana Ibungoda hairak-i, “Makhoigi anggur mahi loikhre.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Masida nahakna eibu karigi yaohallibano? Eigi matam laktri.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Thougal touriba mioising aduda Jisugi mamana hairak-i, “Mahakna haiba haiba khudingmak nakhoina tou.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Isingna sengdokpagi chatnabi ama Jihudisinggi lei, maram adugidamak ising hapnaba nunggi kharung taruk mapham aduda leirammi, kharung ama-mamda chourakna ising litre chamamuk chan-gani. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Thougal touribasing aduda Jisuna hairak-i, “Kharungsing aduda ising thanna hapchillu.” Maram aduna makhoina kharungsing aduda ising pik-thanna hapchille. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Adudagi Ibungona makhoida hairak-i, “Houjik khara kanthoklaga arang-purel aduda purucho.” Ibungona haiba adu makhoina toure, <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>aduga arang-purel aduna anggur mahi onkhraba ising adu mahao tangle. Ising adu kallakpa thougal toubasing aduna khanglabasu mahaknadi kadaidagi anggur mahi adu puraklibano haiba khanglamde. Adudagi mahakna luhonggadouriba nupa adu koure <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>aduga hairak-i, “Mi khudingna ahanbada khwaidagi phaba anggur mahi adu puthoknei aduga misingna marang kaina thaklaba matungda khara hanthaba aduna konna puthoknei; adubu nahakti houjik phaoba khwaidagi phaba asi khaklamli.”<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Jisuna touba ahanba angakpa khudam asi Galilee-gi Cana-da pangthokkhi; mapham aduda Ibungona mahakki matik mangal utpire aduga Ibungogi tung-inbasingna Ibungobu thajare.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:13">Mat 4:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Masigi matungda Jisuna mahakki mama, machin manao amadi mahakki tung-inbasingga loinana Capernaum-da chatlammi. Mapham aduda makhoina numit khara leirammi.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Mapugi Sanglen sengdokpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12">Mat 21:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mrk 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45">Luk 19:45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 19:46">46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Khong 12:1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lanthokpibagi Chakkhangbagi matam naksillaklammi maram aduna Jisuna Jerusalem-da chatlammi. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Mapugi Sanglenda misingna sa-sal, yao amasung khunusing yonbadu Ibungona thengnare aduga mapham aduda phamliba sel-kaibasing adusu ure. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Maram aduna Ibungona thouridagi sajei semlaga yao amadi sa-sal loina Ningnasangdagi tanthokle; Ibungona sel-kaibasingdugi table-singdu mathak makha onthokle aduga makhoigi sel achoibasingdu chaikhaire; <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>aduga Ibungona khunu yonbasing aduda hairak-i, “Khunusingdu mapham asidagi puthokkho! Eigi Ipagi yumbu keithel onthokkanu.” <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Isei 69:9</ref></char></note>Ibungogi tung-inbasingna Mapu Ibungogi puyada i-ba wahei haibadi, “Ibungo nahakki yumgidamak thawai yaojabana eigi nungda meigumna chakle” haiba asi ningsinglakle.<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Jihudigi luchingbasingna Jisuda hanglak-i, “Masising asi toubagi nahakki matik lei haiba utnanaba nahakna karamba angakpa khudam eikhoida utpa ngamgani”<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mat 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mrk 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">15:29</ref></char>
    </note>Maduda Jisuna makhoida paokhum pirak-i, “Mapugi Sanglen asi thugaiyu aduga eina numit humnigi manungda amuk hanna sage.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Makhoina khumlak-i, “Mapugi Sanglen asi chahi niphu-taruk changna sakhibani aduga nahakna numit humnida sagadouribra?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Adubu Ibungona hairiba sanglen adudi Ibungo mahakki hakchang adubuni. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Maram aduna Ibungona sibadagi hinggatlakpa matamduda mahakki tung-inbasingna Ibungona haikhiba asi ningsinglakkhi aduga makhoina Mapugi puya amadi Jisuna haikhiba wasing aduda thajare.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mioibagi mahousagi maramda Jisuna khangba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Lanthokpibagi chakkhangba matamda Jisusu Jerusalem-da leirammi aduga Ibungona touba angakpa khudamsing adu miyamna ure aduga makhoina Ibungobu thajare. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Adubu Jisuna masana masabu makhoida thajana sinnade maramdi mahakna mi khudingmakpu khanglammi. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Kanagumba amatana mioibagi maramda Ibungoda haibagi kanaba leite maramdi Ibungo masana mioibagi nungda kari lei haiba khanglammi.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu amasung Nicodemus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Pharisee-singgi maraktagi Nicodemus kouba Jihudisinggi luchingba ama leirammi. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Nongma numidang amada mahakna Jisugi manakta laklaga hairak-i, “Oja Ibungo, nahakti Tengban Mapuna thabirakpa oja amani haiba eikhoina khangjei. Maramdi nahakna touriba angakpa khudamsing asi Mapu Ibungona loinabidrabadi kana amatana touba ngamloi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Jisuna khumlak-i, “Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairiba asini, kanagumba amana amuk-hanna poktrabadi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nattraga “Mathaktagi pokpa nattrabadi”</char></note> mahakna Tengban Mapugi Leibak adu uba ngamloi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Maduda Nicodemus-na Ibungoda hanglak-i, “Karamna ahal oiraba mi amana amuk hanna pokpa yagadouribano? Mahakna mamagi puknungda aniraksuba oina changduna amuk pokpa haibasi sukya yaroidaba amani!”<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Jisuna khumlak-i, “Eina nakhoida tasengna hairiba asini, kanagumba amana ising amasung Thawaidagi poktrabadi mahakna Tengban Mapugi Leibakta changba ngamloi. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Hakchanggi oinadi mama mapana pokpibani adubu thawaigi oinadi Thawaina pokpibani. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>‘Nakhoi amuk-hanna pokkadabani’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nattraga “Mathaktagi pokpa tai”</char></note> haina eina hairiba asida nahak ngakkanu. <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Nungsitna sitning sitningba maphamsingda sitli aduga nahakna madugi makholdi tai adubu madu kadaidagi lakpano aduga kadaida chatlibano haiba adudi nahakna khangde. Adugumduna Thawaina poklaba makhoi adusuni.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Maduda Nicodemus-na hanglak-i, “Masi kamdouna oithokkadouribano?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Jisuna khumlak-i, “Nahak Israel-gi oja ama oiraga masising asi khangdabra? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, eikhoina khangba amadi uba adu eikhoina hai adubu nakhoinadi eikhoina haiba adu louningde. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Eina nakhoida taibangpanbagi oibasing adugi maramda haibada nakhoina thajade adu oirabadi swargagi oibasing adugi maramda haibada nakhoina kamdouna thajagani? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Swargadagi kumthabirakpa Migi Machanupa adu nattana kana amatana swargada kadri.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:9">Masing 21:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Korina saba lil adu Moses-na lamjao lamhangda thanggatkhiba adugumduna Migi Machanupa adubusu thanggatpa tai, <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>madu mahakpu thajaba mi khudingna lomba naidaba punsi phangnanabani. <verse eid="JHN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Tengban Mapuna taibangpanbabu asukki matik nungsibire aduna mahakki amatta ngairaba Machanupa adu pibire, maram aduna Machanupa adubu thajaba mi khudingna mangdaduna lomba naidaba hingba phangjananabani. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Tengban Mapuna mahakki Machanupa adubu wayennaba taibangpanda thabiba natte adubu mahakki mapanna taibangpanbabu kanbinanabani.<verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Machanupa adubu thajaba makhoi adu wayen toubide adubu thajadaba makhoi adugidi wayen loikhre maramdi makhoina amatta ngairaba Tengban Mapugi Machanupa adubu thajade. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Wayen adu asini madudi mangal aduna taibangpanda lakle adubu misingnadi amamba thabakna henna pambagi maramna makhoina mangaldagi amambana henna pammi maramdi makhoigi thabaksing phattaba oirammi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Phattaba touba mi khudingna mangal adubu tukkachei maramdi makhoigi thabaksingdu phongdokkani haiba kibagi maramna makhoina mangalda lakloi. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Adubu achumba toubasingnadi mangalda lak-i maramdi makhoina touba thabaksing adu Tengban Mapugi haiba inba oina toubani haibadu mangal aduna utnanabani.<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu amadi baptize toubiba John</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Masigi matungda Jisu amadi mahakki tung-inbasingna Judea-gi lamda chatlammi aduga mapham aduda Ibungona makhoiga loinana matam khara leiminnarammi amasung misingbu baptize toubirammi. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Salim-dagi panglap laptana leiba Aenon-da ising marang kaina leibagi maramna John-nasu mapham aduda baptize tourammi. Misingna mahakki manakta chatlammi aduga mahakna makhoibu baptize toubirammi. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mrk 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19">Luk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char></note>(Masi John-bu keisumsangda thamdringeigi mamangdani.)<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>John-gi tung-inba kharaga Jihudi amaga laininggi oiba isingna chamthokpagi maramda makhoi yetnarammi. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Makhoina John-gi manakta chattuna John-da hairammi, “Oja Ibungo, Jordan-gi wangmada nahakka leiminnaramba nupa haibadi nahakna mahakki maramda haibikhiba mahak aduna houjik baptize toubiri aduga mi pumnamakna mahakki manakta chatli.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Maduda John-na khumlak-i, “Mapu Ibungona pibiba nattana kana amatana karisu phangba ngamloi. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Jn 1:20</ref></char></note>‘Eidi Christta adu natte, adubu eidi Ibungo mahakki mang thana thabirakpani’ haina eina haikhiba adu nakhoina khanglibaduni. <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Mou anoubi phangliba mahak adu bor aduni adubu bor adugi marup adudi mapham aduda bor adugidamak leijabani amadi mahakki khonjel tajaba aduni, marup aduna bor adugi khonjel tajabada adukki matik haraojei. Madugi haraoba adu eihakkini aduga haraoba adu houjik mapung phare. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Ibungo mahakti chaokhatlakpa tai aduga eidi hantharakpa tai.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Swargadagi lengthabirakpa Ibungo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>Mathaktagi lengthabirakpa Ibungo mahakti pumnamakki mathakta lei. Taibangpanbagi oiba mahak adudi taibangpanba asigini aduga mahakna taibangpanbagi oiba mi amagumna wa ngang-i adubu swargadagi lengthabirakpa Ibungo mahakti pumnamakki mathakta lei. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>Ibungo mahakna ukhraba amadi takhraba adu haibi adubu mi kana amatanadi Ibungogi wa adu loubide. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Adum oinamak Ibungogi wa adubu lousinjaba makhoina Tengban Mapudi achumbani haibadu yajare. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Tengban Mapuna thabirakpa mahak adudi Tengban Mapugi wa ngang-i maramdi Tengban Mapuna mangonda Thawai adu mapan naidana pibi. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Mapa aduna mahakki Machanupa adubu nungsi aduga Machanupa adugi makhutta pumnamak sinnabire. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Machanupa adubu thajaba mi aduna lomba naidaba hingba adu phangle; Machanupa adugi wa indaba mahak aduna hingba phangloi adubu Mapu Ibungogi asaoba mahakki mathakta leigani.<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu amadi Samaria-gi nupi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Ibungona John-dagi mi masing henna tung-inbasing semduna baptize toure haiba Pharisee-singna tare haibasi Jisuna khangle. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>Asengbamakti Jisu masanadi makhoibu baptize touba natte mahakki tung inbasingna toubani. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Maram asina Ibungona Judea thadoktuna Galilee-da amuk hallammi. <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Ibungogi khongchat adu Samaria phaoduna chatpa tarammi.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 33:19">Meihou 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Joshu 24:32</ref></char>
    </note>Ibungona asum lakpada Sychar kouba Samaria-gi sahar amada thunglammi. Mapham adu Jacob-na mahakki machanupa Joseph-ta pikhiba lam machet adugi manaktani. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Jacob-ki oiramba guha adu mapham aduda leirammi; Ibungona lamsang chatpadagi waraduna guha adugi manakta phamthare. Pungpham adu numit yungba matamni.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Tanja aduda Samaria-gi nupi amana mapham aduda ising sokpa laklammi, maduda Ibungona mangonda hairak-i, “Eingonda thaknaba ising khara pibiyu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>(Matamdu Ibungogi tung-inbasingna khunggang aduda chana thaknaba leiba chatkhibagi maramna Ibungo mathantamak leirammi.)<verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 4:1-5">Ezra 4:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:1">Nehe 4:1</ref>,<ref loc="NEH 4:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>Maduda nupi aduna hairak-i, “Nahakti Jihudini aduga eina Samaria-gi nupini aduga kamdouna nahakna eingonda thaknaba ising piyu hairibano?” (Jihudisingdi Samaria-gi misingna sijinnaba kol-lik sijinnade.)<verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Jisuna khumlak-i, “Nahakna Tengban Mapugi khudol adu khanglamlaba aduga nangonda thaknaba ising piyu hairiba mahak adu kanano haiba khanglamlabadi, nahakna mangonda nijaramgadabani aduga mahakna nangonda hingba piba ising adu pibiramgadabani.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Nupi aduna hairak-i, “Ibungo, guha asisu yamna lui aduga nangonda ising sokkatnaba kon amattasu yaode aduga kadaidagi hingba piba ising adu lougadouribano? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Guha asibu piramba eikhoigi ipa ipu oiriba Jacob-tagi nahakna henna chaobra? Mahak masamak, machasing amadi mahakki sa sansingsu guha asigi ising thakkhi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Guha asigi ising thakpa mi khudingmak amuk khouranglakkani <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>adubu eina piba ising adu thakpa mi khudingmak adudi makhoida khourangba amuk hanna leiraroi. Eina pigadaba ising aduna makhoida hingba piba iphut oiraktuna makhoida lomba naidaba hingba pibigani.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Nupi aduna hairak-i, “Ibungo, eingonda khourangba amuk leitanaba aduga mapham asida ising sokpa amuk laktanaba eingonda ising adu pibiyu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Maduda Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Chatlu, nahakki napuroiba kouraklaga mapham asida lak-u.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Nupi aduna khumlak-i, “Eigi ipuroiba leijade.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Maduda Jisuna hairak-i, “Nahakki napuroiba leite haibadu achumbani. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Achumbamakti, nahakki napuroiba manga leirammi aduga nahakka houjik leiminnariba nupa adusu nahakki napuroiba natte. Nahakna houjik haikhibadu yamna chummi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Nupi aduna hairak-i, “Ibungo, nahak asi Mapu Ibungogi wa phongdokpa maichou ama oigani haiba eina khangjare. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Eikhoi Samaria-gi ipa ipusingnadi Gerizim chingthak asida Tengban Mapubu khurumjei adubu nakhoi Jihudisingnadi Tengban Mapu khurumgadaba maphamdi Jerusalem-da oigadabani haina karigi hairibano?”<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Nupi, eibu thajou, nakhoina Ipa adubu ching asida chatlaga nattraga Jerusalem-da chatlaga khurumloidaba matam adu lakli. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Nakhoi Samaria-singdi nakhoina khurumliba Mapu Ibungo mahakpu munna khangde adubu eikhoi Jihudisingdi eikhoina khurumliba Mapu Ibungo mahakpu khang-i maramdi aran-khubham asi Jihudisingdagi lakpani. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Thamoi sengna khurumjaribasingna Ipa adubu thawaida amadi achumbada khurumgadaba matam adu lakli aduga matam adu houjik oisu oiri. Ipa aduna adugumna khurumjabasing adubu thiri. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Tengban Mapudi Thawaini maram aduna Ibungo mahakpu khurumjabasingna thawaida amadi achumbada khurumjagadabani.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Nupi aduna Ibungoda hairak-i, “Christta kouba Messiah adu lakkani haiba eina khang-i aduga mahakna lakpa matamda mahakna eikhoida maram pumnamak loina sandokna takpigani.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Adudagi Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Nangonda wari sariba eihak asi mahak aduni.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Tanja adumaktada Jisugi tung-inbasing adu mapham aduda hallaklammi. Ibungona nupi amaga wari sanaramba adu ubada makhoi yamna ngaklammi adum oinamak “Ibungona mangondagi kari pambage?” nattraga “Ibungona karigi mahakka wari saribano?” haina makhoina Ibungoda hanglamde.<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Nupi aduna mahakki ising pun adu guha manakta thanamlaga mahakki khunda chenkhiduna khundugi misingda hairammi, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>“Eina toukhi toukhiba khudingmak eingonda loina haibiba nupa ama yeng-u lao. Mahaksibu Christta adu oiramgadra?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Maram aduna miyam aduna khun adudagi thoraktuna Jisugi manakta laklammi.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Cheirak aduda Jisugi tung-inbasingna Jisuda kanna haijarammi, “Oja Ibungo, khara chabiyu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Maduda Ibungona khumlak-i, “Nakhoina sungkhang khangdaba eigi chanaba chinjak leire.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Maram aduna Ibungogi tung-inbasing aduna makhoi masel amaga amaga hangnarammi, “Eikhoina chatthoklingeida kanagumba amana Ibungogi chanaba puraklamba oigadra?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Eigi chinjakti eibu thabirakpa Ibungo mahakki aningba touba amadi mahakki thabakpu mapung phana loisinba aduni. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Nakhoina asumna hainaba nattra, ‘Tha mari leiraga lourok tha oirani?’ Adubu eina nakhoida hairi, loubuksing asida yeng-u! Makhoi khoingang sare khaoba yare. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Maru hunba mahakka akhaoba mahakka punna haraominnanaba, akhaoba mahak adu khutsuman phang-i amasung lomba naidaba hingbagi mahei khomjilli. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Hainaba asi achumbani, ‘Kanagumba mi amana maru hulli aduga atoppa kanagumba mi amana khao-i.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Nakhoina thabak suba yaorudaba loubukta khaorunanaba eina nakhoibu thare. Atoppa misingna awaba thabaksing adu subiramle aduga makhoina subirambagi kannaba adu nakhoina phangle.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>“Eina toukhi toukhiba khudingmak mahakna eingonda loina haibi” haina nupi aduna haibagi maramna khun adugi Samaria macha mayam amana Jisubu thajarammi. <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Makhoina Ibungogi manakta lakpa matamda, Ibungobu makhoiga leiminnanaba makhoina Ibungoda kanna haijarammi, maram aduna Ibungona mapham aduda numit nini amaga leire. <verse eid="JHN 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Aduga atoppa mi mayam amasu Ibungona haiba wa tabadagi thajare. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Makhoina nupi aduda hairak-i, “Houjikti nahakna haiba khaktadagi eikhoina thajaba nattre adubu eikhoi isamak Ibungona haiba tajare. Tasengnamak Ibungo mahak asi taibangpan asigi Kanbiba Mapu aduni.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phamnaiba amagi machanupa amabu Jisuna phahanbiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Mapham aduda numit nini leiramlaba matungda, Jisuna Galilee-da chatlammi. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mat 13:57</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:4">Mrk 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luk 4:24</ref></char></note>Ibungo masamakna asumna haikhi, “Mapu Ibungogi wa phongdokpa maichousingdi makhoi masagi lamsingda ikai khumnabide.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Jn 2:23</ref></char></note>Ibungona Galilee-da thungba matamda mapham adugi misingna Ibungobu taramna oklammi maramdi makhoina Lanthokpibagi chakkhangbagi thouramgidamak Jerusalem-da chatlubada mapham aduda Ibungona toukhiba thabak pumnamak loina makhoina ukhibagini.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">Jn 2:1-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jisuna isingbu anggur mahi olhanbikhiba mapham Galilee-gi Cana kouba khun aduda Ibungona amuk hanna chatlammi. Aduga Capernaum-da leiba ningthougi phamnaiba amagi machanupa ama narammi. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Jisuna Judea-dagi Galilee-da lakle haiba tabadagi mahakki sigadabagi phibamda nariba machanupa adubu phahanbinaba mahakna Jisugi manakta chattuna Capernaum-da lakpinanaba haijarammi. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Maduda Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Nakhoina khudamsing amadi angak angakpasing udriba phaoba nakhoina keidounungda thajaroi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Phamnaiba aduna khumlak-i, “Ibungo, eigi angang adu sidringeida lakpiyu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Nayumda hallo, nahakki nachanupa naba pharagani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Maduda phamnaiba aduna Jisuna mangonda haibiba wahei adu thajaduna mahakki mayumda chatpa hourammi. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Mahakna hallakpagi lambida leireingeida mahakki macha adu naba phaduna hingle haibagi pao mahakki manaisingna mangonda puraklammi. <verse eid="JHN 4:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Karamba matamda angang adu phagatlakkhibage hangbada makhoina khumlak-i, “Ngarang numit yungba matung pung ama taba matamda mahakki laihou adu khanghoudana thakhre.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Maduda Jisuna mangonda, “Nahakki nachanupa adu pharagani” haibikhiba pungja adumaktadani haiba mapa aduna khangle. Maram aduna mahak amadi mahakki imung manung loina Jisubu thajare.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Masi Jisuna Judea-dagi Galilee-da laklaba matungda touba anisuba angakpa khudamni.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna anaba mi amabu phahanba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Masigi matung matam khara leiraga Jisuna Jihudisinggi chakkhangba amagidamak Jerusalem-da chatlammi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Jerusalem-da leiba Yaogi Thong adugi manakta hojang manga leiba pukhri ama lei; pukhri adu Hebrew londa Bethesda kou-i. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Hojangsing aduda anaba mayam ama leirammi; makhoi kharana mit tangba, kharana khong tekpa amadi pangthaduna nabasing oirammi. [<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anganbagi lairik kharadadi masigi saruk asi yaode</char></note>Makhoina pukhri adugi ising adu lenglakpa ngairammi. <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Maramdi marak marakta Mapu Ibungogi dut amana kumtharaktuna ising adu leng-halli aduga ising adu lenglingeida pukhri aduda i-han hanna kumthaba mi aduda leiramba leina ama hekta oirabasu pharammi.] <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Mapham aduda chahi kunthranipan chupna naraklaba nupa ama leirammi. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Mahakna mapham aduda hiptuna leibadu ubada mahak asi kuina naraklaba mini haiba Jisuna khangladuna mangonda hanglak-i, “Nahak phaningbra?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Anaba mi aduna khumlak-i, “Ibungo, ising asi leng-hallakpa matamda eibu pukhri asida puthabinaba eigidamak kanagumba amata leijade. Aduga eina kumthanaba hotnaringeida atoppa mi amana hanna hekta kumthakhi.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Maduda Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Hougatlu, nahakki hipnapham adu loukhatlaga chatlu!” <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Khudak aduda nupa adugi anaba adu phare aduga mahakna mahakki hipnapham adu loukhattuna chatpa hourammi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Angakpa thoudok asi potthaba numitta thokkhibani. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:19">Nehe 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Jer 17:21</ref></char></note>Maram aduna anaba phakhiba nupa aduda Jihudigi luchingbasingna hairak-i, “Ngasi asi potthaba numitni aduna potthaba numitta nahakna nahakki hipnapham puba adu wayel yathangna ayaba pide.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Maduda mahakna khumlak-i, “Eibu phahanbiba nupa aduna eingonda, ‘Nahakki hipnapham adu loukhatlaga chatlu,’ haina eingonda haibirak-i.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Makhoina nupa aduda hanglak-i, “Nangonda nahakki hipnapham adu loukhatlaga chatlu hairakliba nupa adu kanano?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Adubu anaba phakhiba nupa adunadi Jisubu kanano haiba khanglamde maramdi Jisuna mapham aduda leiramba miyamsing adugi marakta changsillaga litthokkhirammi.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Madugi matungda Jisuna mahakpu ningnasangda thengnare aduga mangonda hairak-i, “Yeng-u, houjik nahak phare maram aduna nahak pap amuk hanna touraganu nattrabadi nangonda henna phattaba thoklakpa yai.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Adudagi nupa aduna Jihudigi luchingbasing adugi manakta chattuna mahakpu anaba phahanbiba nupa adu Jisuni haina pao tamlure. <verse eid="JHN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Jisuna asigumba thabaksing asi potthaba numitta toubagi maramna makhoina Jisubu ot-neiba houre. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Adubu Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Eigi Ipadi matam pumnamakta thabak tou-i maram aduna eihaksu thabak touba tabani.” <verse eid="JHN 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Maram asina Jihudigi luchingbasingna Ibungobu hatnanaba henna kanna hotnarammi maramdi potthaba numitpu Ibungona thugaiba khakta nattana Tengban Mapubu mahakmakki Mapa haina kouduna mahak masamakpu Tengban Mapuga mannahalli.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Machanupa adugi matik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Maram aduna Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Eina nakhoida tasengna hairiba asini, Machanupa adu mahak masana karisu touba ngamde adubu mahakki Mapa aduna touri touriba adu uba adukhakta mahakna tou-i. Mapa aduna touba touba makhei Machanupa adunasu tou-i. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Maramdi Mapa aduna Machanupa adubu nungsi amadi mahak masana touriba pumnamak Machanupa aduda utpi. Masidagi henna chaoba thabaksing phaoba mahakna Machanupa aduda utpigani maduda nakhoi angakpa oigani. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Mapa aduna sibadagi hinggat-hanbiba makhoida mahakna hingba pibibagumna Machanupa adunasu mahakna piningba makhoida hingba pibi. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Madugisu mathakta Mapa aduna kanagumba amatabu wayende adubu wayel pumba Machanupa aduda sinnei, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>masina Mapa aduda ikai khumnabagum Machanupa adudasu ikai khumnanabani. Machanupa adubu ikai khumnadaba mahak aduna Machanupa adubu thabirakliba Mapa adubusu ikai khumnade.<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>“Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairiba asini, eigi wa taba amadi eibu thabirakpa Ibungo mahakpu thajaba makhoi adu lomba naidaba hingba phangle. Makhoigi mathakta wayenba leiraroi; makhoidi sibadagi hingbada hannana lanthokkhre. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairiba asini, asibasingna Tengban Mapugi Machanupa adugi khonjel adu tagadaba matam adu lakli thanggeisengnamakti matam adu houjik oire aduga khonjel adu tabasingna hingjagani. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Mapa masamak adu hingbagi hourakpham oiba adugumna Ibungo mahaknasu mahakki Machanupa adubu hingbagi hourakpham oihalli. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Aduga mahak asi Migi Machanupa oibagi maramna Mapa aduna mangonda wayennabagi matik pibire. <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>Masida nakhoi ngakkanu, asibasingna Migi Machanupa adugi khonjel tagadaba matam adu lakli <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref></char></note>aduga makhoina makhoigi mongphamsingdagi thorakkani: aphaba toukhibasingna hingnanaba hougatlakkani aduga phattaba toukhibasingna maral leire haibagi wayen phangnanaba hougatlakkani.<verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu kanano haiba taklibasing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>“Ei isa ithantana karisu touba ngamde; Mapu Ibungona eingonda haibiraklaga eina wayelli. Eigi wayendi achumbani maramdi eina eigi aningba adu toude adubu eibu thabirakpa Ibungo mahakki aningba adu tou-i.<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>“Eina isagi maramda haijarabadi, eina haijariba adu chatnaba yaroi. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Adubu kanagumba amana eigi maramda haibiri aduga mahakna eigi maramda hairiba pumnamak adu achumbani haiba eina khang-i. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-27">Jn 1:19-27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:27-30">3:27-30</ref></char></note>Nakhoina John-gi maphamda thijinba mi tharure aduga mahakna achumba adugi maramda haire. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Adubu mioibana eigi maramda haibiba adu eina louba natte adubu nakhoina kanbiba phangnanaba eina masi haibani. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>John-di chaktuna ngalliba thaomei amagum oirammi aduga nakhoina mahakki mangal aduda matam kharagi oina harao nungaiba pambani. <verse eid="JHN 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>Adubu John-na eigi maramda haibiba adudagi henna chaoba eigi maramda haibiba lei madudi eina touba thabaksingni haibadi Ipana eingonda mapung phana loisinnaba pibirakpa thabaksing asina eibu Ipana thabirakpani haiba utpi. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mrk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3:22</ref></char></note>Aduga eibu thabirakpa Ipa adunasu eigi maramda haibi. Nakhoinadi Ibungo mahakki khonjel amukta takhidri aduga mahakki maithongsu ukhidri, <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>amadi nakhoigi thamoinungda Ibungo mahakki wahei leite maramdi Ibungona tharakpa mahak adubu nakhoina thajade. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Nakhoina Mapugi puyabu thawai yaona neinei maramdi puyaduda nakhoina lomba naidana hingba adu phanggani haina khalli. Adubu Mapugi puya adumakna eigi maramda hairi! <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Aduga nakhoina hingba phangjanaba eigi inakta lakpasu lakningde.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>“Eidi mioibagi thagatpa adu thide. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Adubu eina nakhoibu khang-i. Nakhoigi thamoinungda Tengban Mapubu nungsiba adu leite haiba eina khang-i. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Eina eigi Ipagi mingda nakhoigi nakta lakle adubu nakhoina eibu lousinbide aduga kanagumba amana masagi mingda laklabadi nakhoina mahakpu lousin-gani. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Amatta ngairaba Tengban Mapu mangondagi thagatpa phangnaba nakhoina hotnadraga nakhoi nasen amana amadagi thagatnaba lounaba pamliba nakhoina kamdouna eibu thajaba ngamgani. <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Ipagi maphamda nakhoibu maral sigadaba misak adu eini haina nakhoina khan-ganu. Nakhoina thajaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asa haibani</char></note> thamjariba Moses masamakna nakhoibu maral sigani. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Nakhoina Moses-pu tasengna thajaramlabadi, nakhoina eibu thajaramgadabani maramdi mahakna eigi maramda irammi. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Adubu mahakna iramba adu nakhoina thajadrabadi kamdouna eina haiba wa nakhoina thajagadage?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna mi lising mangabu pijaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mrk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-11">Luk 9:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Masigi matung matam khara leiraga Jisuna Tiberias-gi pat hainasu khangnaba Galilee-gi pat adugi wangmada lanthoktuna chatlammi. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Yamkhraba miyam amana Ibungogi tung induna chatlammi maramdi Ibungona anaba phahanbagi angakpa khudamsing adu makhoina ubagini. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Adudagi Jisuna ching amada kakhattuna mahakki tung-inbasingga loinana mapham aduda phamlammi. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Jihudisinggi Lanthokpibagi Chakkhangba matam adu naksillaklammi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Ibungona yengkhatlakpada yamlaba miyam amana Ibungogi nakta lakpa adu urabada Ibungona Philip-ta onsillaklaga hairak-i, “Makhoising asi pijananaba tal eikhoina kadaidagi leigadage?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Ibungona kari tougadabano haiba hannana khanglabani adubu Philip-pu chang yengnanaba Ibungona masi haibani.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Maduda Philip-na khumlak-i, “Sinmi amagi tha nipanmukki khutsuman-gi peisana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">denarii chani</char></note> pijananaba tal adu leiraba phaoba makhoi khudingmakna khajik khajiktang charabasu konnaroi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Ibungogi tung-inba ama oiriba aduga Simon Peter-gidi manaonupa Andrew-na Ibungoda hairak-i, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>“Barley-gi tal manga amadi nga macha ani yaoriba nupamacha ama mapham asida leire. Adubu asuk yamkhraba miyam asida asising asinadi kari tourugani?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Miyam adu phamthahallu.” Mapham aduda napi marang kaina hourammi. Maram aduna makhoi phamthare. (Nupa khaktada lising mangamukni.) <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Adudagi Jisuna tal adu louraga Mapu Ibungobu thagatle aduga phamliba miyam aduda yenthokle. Matou adugumna ngasing adusu yenthokle aduga makhoi loina oktri phaoba chare. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Makhoina mapuk thanna charabada, Jisuna mahakki tung-inbasingda hairak-i, “Kari amata manghan-ganu; lemhouba machet makaising adu khomjillu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Maram aduna makhoina lemhouba machet makaising adu khomjille amasung miyam aduna barley-gi tal manga adudagi chakhraga lemhouba machet makaising aduna thumok taranithoi thalle.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Mising aduna Ibungona touba angakpa khudam adu ubada makhoina hairak-i. “Tasengnamak taibangpan asida lengbirakkadaba Mapu Ibungogi wa phongdokpa Maichou adu mahak asini.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Makhoina Ibungobu pharaga namphuda ningthou semgadoure haiba khangladuna Ibungona matomta ching amada chatthokkhre.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna ising mathakta khongna chatpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-23">Mat 14:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mrk 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Numidangwairam oiraklabada Jisugi tung-inbasingna patta kumthare <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>aduga hi amada tonglaga Capernaum-gidamak pat adugi wangmada chatlammi. Matam adu mamsinkhre adubu Jisudi makhoigi manakta laktri. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Matam aduda akanba nungsit ama laktuna pat adu ithak hourammi. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Ibungogi tung-inbasingna mile ahum marirom hi hollaba matungda Jisuna ising mathakta khongna chattuna hi adugi manakta changsillakpa adu makhoina ubada makhoi yamna kirammi. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Eini, kiganu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Adudagi makhoina yaningna Ibungobu hida changhalle aduga khudak aduda hi adu makhoina chatliba mapham adugi torbanda thungle.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Misingna Jisubu thiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Mathanggi numitta pat adugi wangmada leihouba mising aduna mapham aduda hi amakhakta leirambani aduga hi aduda Jisugi tung-inbasingna chatkhibada Jisudi yaokhide haiba makhoina khanglammi. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Mapu Ibungobu thagatcharaba matungda misingna tal chakhiba mapham adugi manakki torbanda Tiberias-tagi hi khara laklammi. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Miyam aduna Jisu amadi mahakki tung-inbasing mapham aduda leitre haiba khanglabada makhoina hising aduda tonglaga Capernaum tana Ibungobu thiba chatlammi.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hingbagi tal oiriba Jisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Aduga makhoina pat adugi wangmada Jisubu phanglabada makhoina Ibungoda hairak-i, “Oja Ibungo, karamba matamda Ibungona mapham sida lengbirakpage?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i, “Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, nakhoina angakpa khudamsing adu khangbagi maramna nakhoina eibu thirakpa natte adubu nakhoina tal pukthanna chakhibagi maramnani. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Manggadaba chinjakkidamak thabak suganu adubu lomba naidaba hingba phaoba leiba chinjak adugidamak thabaksu. Masigi chinjak asidi Migi Machanupa aduna nakhoida pibigani maramdi Tengban Mapu Mapa Ibungo aduna mangonda yabibagi khudam nambire.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Maram aduna makhoina Ibungoda hanglak-i, “Eikhoina Tengban Mapugi thabaksing adu tounaba eikhoina kari touba tabage?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Ibungo mahakna thabiraklaba mahak adubu nakhoina thajaba haiba asi Tengban Mapugi thabak aduni.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Makhoina khumlak-i, “Eikhoina ujaraga Ibungobu thajanaba Ibungona kari angakpa khudam toubigani? Ibungona kari toubigani? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Khong 16:4</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Isei 78:24</ref></char></note>‘Mahakna makhoida swargadagi chanaba tal pibikhi’ haina Mapu Ibungogi puyada ibagumna eikhoigi ipa ipusingna leikanglada leiringeida makhoina manna chakhi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Maduda Jisuna hairak-i, “Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, swargadagi tal pikhiba adu Moses-na natte adubu eigi Ipana nakhoida swargadagi achumba tal adu pibi. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Tengban Mapugi tal adudi swargadagi kumtharakpa amadi taibangpanda hingba pibiba mahak aduni.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Makhoina hairak-i, “Ibungo, tal adu matam pumnamakta eikhoida pibiyu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Hingbagi tal adu eini. Eingonda lakpa mi adu keidoungeidasu lamlaroi; eingonda thajaba mi adu keidoungeidasu khouranglaroi. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Adubu eina nakhoida hannana haikhre adudi nakhoina eibu ukhre adubu houjiksu nakhoina thajade. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Eigi Ipana eingonda pibiba makhoi pumnamak adu eingonda lakkani aduga eingonda lakpa mi amatabu eina khak tanthokloi. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Maramdi eina eigi aningba tounaba swargadagi kumtharakpa natte adubu eibu thabirakpa Ibungo mahakki aningba tounanaba kumtharakpani. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Eibu thabirakpa Ibungo mahakki aningba adudi asini, Ibungo mahakna eingonda pibikhraba makhoi kana amatabu eina mang-handaduna aroiba numitta makhoibu hinggat-hanba aduni. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Eigi Ipagi aningba adudi Machanupa adubu ujaba amadi Ibungo mahakpu thajaba makhoi pumnamakna lomba naidaba hingba phangbani aduga eina makhoibu aroiba numitta hinggat-hanbigani.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>“Swargadagi kumtharakpa tal adu eini” haina Ibungona haibagi maramna Jihudisingna Ibungogi maramda yaningdabagi murum murum sonba hourammi. <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>“Mahak asi Joseph-ki machanupa Jisu adu nattra? Mahakki mama mapa eikhoina khang-i. Aduga kamdouna mahakna ‘Ei swargadagi kumtharakpani’ haina hairibano?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Nakhoi nasen-gi narakta murum murum sonnariba adu leppu. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Eibu thabirakpa Ipa aduna chingsinbidrabadi kanagumba amatana eigi inakta lakpa ngamde aduga aroiba numitta eina makhoibu hinggat-hanbigani. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa 54:13</ref></char></note>Mapu Ibungogi wa phongdokpibasingna asumna irammi, ‘Tengban Mapuna makhoi pumnamakpu tambigani.’ Ipagi khonjel taba amadi Ibungo mangondagi tamjaba makhoina eingonda lakkani. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Masina Ipa adubu kanagumba amana ukhare haibadi natte; Tengban Mapudagi lakpa mahak adu khaktana Ipa adubu ukhre. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, eibu thajaba mahak aduna lomba naidaba hingba phangle. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Hingbagi tal adu eini. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Nakhoigi napa napusingna lamjao lamhangda manna chakhi adubu makhoi sikhi. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Adubu kanagumba amana swargadagi kumtharakpa tal adu charabadi mahak siraroi. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Swargadagi kumtharakpa ahingba tal adu eini. Kanagumbana tal asi charabadi mahak lomba naidana hinggani. Taibangpan asina hingjanaba eina pigadouriba tal adu eigi hakchangni.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Masina Jihudisinggi marakta kanna yetnaduna hainarak-i, “Kamdouna mi asina eikhoida mahakki hakchangbu chanaba oina pigadouribano?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, nakhoina Migi Machanupa adugi hakchang adu chadraba aduga mahakki ee adu thaktrabadi nakhoida hingba leiroi. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Adubu eigi hakchang charaba amadi eigi ee thaklaba mi aduna lomba naidana hingba phangle aduga eina mahakpu aroiba numitta hinggat-hanbigani. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Eigi hakchangdi tasengnamak chinjakni aduga eigi eedi tasengnamak thaknabani. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Eigi hakchangbu chaba amadi eigi eebu thakpa makhoina eingonda lei aduga eina makhoida lei. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Ahingba Ipa aduna eibu thabirakpani aduga Ibungo mahakki maramna ei hingbani, matou adugumna eibu chaba mahak aduna eigi maramna hinggani. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Masini swargadagi kumtharaklaba tal adu. Nakhoigi napa napusingna manna chakhi aduga sikhi adubu tal asi chaba mahak adudi lomba naidana hinggani.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Waramsing asi Ibungona Capernaum-da leiba synagogue-ta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jihudisinggi Ishwor khurumpham, wayenpham amasung wayel yathang tambipham</char></note> tambiringeida haibani.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lomba naidaba hingbagi waheising</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Ibungogi tung-inba mayam amana masi tabada hairak-i, “Masigi tambiba asi yamna lui. Kanana masibu lousinba ngamgani?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Mahakki tung-inbasingna murum murum sonnariba adu khangladuna Ibungona hairak-i, “Masina nakhoida tokningba phaohanbra? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Adu oirabadi Migi Machanupa aduna mahakna hanna leiramba mapham aduda amuk kakhatkhiba nakhoina uba tarabadi kari khan-gani? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Hingba piba adu Mapu Ibungogi Thawainani. Mioibagi panggaldi kari amata kannade. Eina nakhoida haikhiba waheising adu thawai amasung hingbani. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Adubu nakhoi kharanadi eibu thajade.” (Ibungobu kana kanana thajaroidage aduga kanana Ibungobu pithokkadage haibasi houbadagi Ibungona khang-i.) <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Jisuna makha tana hairak-i, “Maram aduna eina nakhoida haikhre, Ipa aduna makhoibu ngamhanbidrabadi makhoi kana amatana eingonda lakpa ngamloi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Maram asina Ibungogi tung-inba mayam ama hankhre aduga Ibungoga amuk chatminnakhidre. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Maram aduna Ibungona mahakki tung-inba taranithoi aduda hanglak-i, “Nakhoisu eibu thadoktuna chatninglabra?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:68,69 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:16">Mat 16:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:29">Mrk 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:20">Luk 9:20</ref></char>
    </note>Maduda Simon Peter-na khumlak-i, “Ibungo, eikhoina kanada chatlugani? Ibungoda lomba naidaba hingba pibiba waheising adu lei. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Aduga Ibungodi Tengban Mapudagi lakpiba Asengba Mahak aduni haiba eikhoina thajei amadi khangjei.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Eina nakhoi taranithoibu khanba nattra? Adubu nakhoigi marakta amadi devil-ni!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Ibungona hairiba adu Simon Iscariot-ki machanupa Judas-gi maramdani. Judas asi Ibungogi tung-inba taranithoigi marakta ama oirabasu mahakna Ibungobu pithokkani.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu amadi mahakki machin manaosing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Masigi matungda Jisuna Galilee-gi lamda koina chatlammi. Maramdi Judea-da leiba Jihudisingna Ibungobu hatnaba hotnabagi maramna Ibungona Judea-da chatpa pamlamde. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Levi 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13">Aniwa 16:13</ref></char></note> Khangpoksanggi chakkhangba hairiba Jihudigi chakkhangba adugi matam naksillaklammi, <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>maram aduna Ibungogi manaosingna Ibungoda hairak-i, “Nahakna touriba angakpa thabaksing adu nahakki tung-inbasingna ujanaba mapham asi thadoktuna Judea-da chatlu. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Masak naiba mi ama oiba pamba kana amatana lonna karisu toude. Nahakna thabaksing asi touribanina nahak taibangpanda phongdok-u.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Ibungogi manaosing phaobana Ibungobu thajaramde.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Eigi achaba matam adu laktri adubu nakhoigidamakti matam khudingmak achabani. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Taibangpan asina nakhoibudi yengthiba ngamde adubu makhoina eibudi yengthi maramdi makhoina toubasing adu phatte haina eina makhoida hai. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Nakhoidi chakkhangba aduda chatlu adubu eidi chakkhangba aduda chatkhiroi maramdi eigi achaba matam adu laktri.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Masi hairaba matungda Ibungona Galilee-da makha tana leitharammi.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Khangpoksanggi chakkhangbada Jisuna chatpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Ibungogi manaosingna chakkhangba aduda chatkhraba matungda Ibungosu chakkhangba aduda chatlammi adubu phongna nattaduna lonna chatlammi. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Jihudigi luchingbasingna Ibungobu chakkhangba aduda thirammi aduga “Mahak kadaida lei?” haiduna makhoina koihang hanglammi.<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Miyamsing adugi marakta Ibungogi maramda murum murum sonnaduna ngangnarammi. Kharana hai, “Mahak aphaba mi amani.” Aduga khara amana amuk hai, “Natte, mahakti miyambu lanna lamjingba mini.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Adum oinamak Jihudigi luchingbasingbu kibagi maramna makhoina Ibungogi maramda phongna wari saramde.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Chakkhangba adu mayai chansillaklabada Jisuna Mapugi Sanglenda chatlaga tambiba hourammi. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Maduda Jihudigi luchingbasing adu yamna ngakladuna hairak-i, “Mahakna suktamsu tamdana kamdouna asuk yamna khanglibano?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Maram aduna Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Eigi tambiba asi eingondagi natte adubu eibu thabirakpa Ibungo mangondagini. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Kanagumbana Tengban Mapugi aningba adu touninglabadi eigi tambiba asi Tengban Mapudagira nattraga eigi isadagira haibadu mahakna khanggani. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Masagi matikna ngangba makhoidi thagatchaba makhoina phangnaba hotnabani. Adubu mahakpu thabirakpa Ibungo mahak adubu thagat-hannaba hotnariba mi adudi achumbani aduga mangonda chumdaba amata leite. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Moses-na nakhoida Wayel Yathang adu pibiba nattra? Adubu nakhoi kana amatana Wayel Yathang adubu inde. Aduga karigi nakhoina eibu hatnaba hotnaribano?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Maduda miyam aduna khumlak-i, “Nahak lai phattaba changba mini. Nahakpu kanana hatke hotnaribage?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Eina angakpa thabak ama tou-i aduga maduda nakhoi loinamak ngak-i. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Levi 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:10">Meihou 17:10</ref></char></note>Moses-na nakhoigi nachasingbu un-kakpagi yathang adu pire (tasengbadi madu Moses-tagi hourakpadi natte adubu ipa ipusingdagini), aduga nakhoina angang adubu potthaba numitta un-kak-i. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:9">Jn 5:9</ref></char></note>Karigumba angang amagi un-kakpagi numit adu potthaba numitta tarabadi nakhoina potthaba numit aduda adumak un kak-i. Madu toubada Wayel Yathang kaidraga eina potthaba numitta mi amabu anaba mapung phana phahanbada nakhoina karigi saogadouribano? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Mapanthongdata yenglaga wayel touganu adubu achumba wayelna wayel tou!”<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu asi Christta adura?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Matang asida Jerusalem-da leiba mi kharana hairak-i, “Makhoina hatke haina hotnariba mi adu asi nattra? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Yeng-u! Mahakna iphong pongna ngangli aduga makhoina mangonda wahei amatasu haide. Eikhoigi luchingbasingna mahakpu Christtani haina tasengna lepkhrabara? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Adubu mahak asidi kadaidagi lakpano haiba eikhoina khang-i adubu Christta aduna lakpa matamdadi kana amatana mahak kadaidagino haiba khangloidabani.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Mapugi Sanglenda Jisuna tambi tambina laona hairak-i, “Hoi, ei kanano amadi ei kadaidagi lakpano haiba nakhoina khang-i. Adubu ei isana iranai oina mapham asida lakpadi natte. Eibu thabirakpa Ibungo mahak adu achumbani. Nakhoinadi mahakpu khangde. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Adubu einadi Ibungo mahakpu khang-i maramdi ei mangondagi lakpani amadi mahakna eibu thabirakpani.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Maduda makhoina Ibungobu phanaba hotnarammi adubu Ibungo mahakki matam adu laktriba maramna makhoina khut tharamde. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Adubu mi mayam amana Ibungobu thajare aduga makhoina hairak-i, “Christta aduna lakpa matamda mi asina toukhibasing adudagi henna mahakna angakpa thabaksing toukhigadra?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu phanaba lanmi tharakpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Jisugi maramda mayamna ngangnaribasing adu tabada Pharisee-sing amadi athoiba purohitsingna Jisubu phananaba Mapugi Sanglen-gi lanmising tharaklammi. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Maduda Jisuna hairak-i, “Eina nakhoiga matam kharaga leiminnakhigani adugi matungda eibu thabirakpa Ibungogi maphamda ei chatlagani. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Nakhoina eibu thigani adubu nakhoina eibu phangloi maramdi eina leigadouriba mapham aduda nakhoi lakpa ngamloi.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Maduda Jihudigi luchingbasingna makhoi masel amaga amaga hangnarak-i, “Eikhoina mahakpu phangloi hairibasi mahak kadaida chatke khallibano? Jihudi taba Greek-ki saharsingda chatkadouribra aduga Greek-ki misingbu tambigadouribra? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>‘Nakhoina eibu thigani aduga nakhoina eibu phangloi’ aduga ‘Eina leiba maphamda nakhoi lakpa ngamloi’ haina mahakna hairibasi kari haininglibano?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hingba-piba isinggi iphut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:36">Levi 23:36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Chakkhangba adugi aroiba amadi khwaidagi maru-oiba numit aduda Jisuna lepkhatlaklaga ahouba khonjelna hairak-i, “Kanagumba mina khouranglabadi mahak eingonda laksanu <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Eze 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zec 14:8</ref></char></note>aduga eingonda thajaba mahak aduna thakchasanu. Mapugi Puyana asumna takpi, ‘Mahakki nungdagi hingba piba isinggi iphutsing chellakkani.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Jisubu thajabasingna phangjagadouriba Thawai adugi maramda masi Jisuna haibani. Ibungogi matik mangal chaohandriba maramna houjik phaobadi Thawai Asengba asi pibidri.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Miyamgi marakta tokhaina tanaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Ibungona hairiba asi tabada mi kharana hairak-i, “Tasengnamak mahak asi eikhoina ngaijariba Mapu Ibungogi wa phongdokpa maichou adumak oigani.”<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Atoppa kharana hai, “Mahak asi Christta aduni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Aduga atoppa mi khara amana amuk hairak-i, “Adubu kamdouna Christtabu Galilee-dagi lakkadouribano? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Samu 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mic 5:2</ref></char></note>Maramdi Christta adudi David ningthougi charon surondagi amadi David-na leiramba Bethlehem sahardagi oigani haina Mapugi puyana sengna takpiba nattra?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Asumna Jisugi maramna miyamsing adu napak tanare. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Mi kharana Jisubu phaba pamlammi adubu mi kana amatana Ibungoda khut tharamde.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jihudigi luchingbasingna thajadaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Mapugi Sanglen-gi lanmisingna Jisubu pharaktana hallakpa matamda athoiba purohitsing amadi Pharisee-singna makhoida hanglak-i, “Nakhoina mahakpu karigi puraktribano?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>“Nupa asina ngangbagumna mi kana amatanasu amukta ngangkhidri.” haina makhoina khumlak-i.<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Maduda Pharisee-sing aduna makhoida hairak-i, “Mahakna nakhoibusu lanna lamjingkhrabra? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Luchingbasinggi maraktagi nattraga Pharisee-singgi maraktagi kana amatana mangonda thajaba yaobra? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Masigi miyam asidi wayel yathang khangdaba sirapki makhada leiba ngaktani.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:1">Jn 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 3:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>Mamangngeida Jisugi manakta chatluba aduga Pharisee amasu oiriba Nicodemus-na makhoida hairak-i, <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>“Eikhoigi wayel yathangna mi amabu mahakna haiba hanna tadringei aduga mahakna touriba adu hanna khangdringeida mi adubu eikhoina wayenba yabra?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Maduda makhoina khumlak-i, “Nahaksu Galilee-dagira? Mapu Ibungogi puya adu ningthijana neinou adu oirabadi Mapu Ibungogi wa phongdokpa maichou<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ariba lairik amada “Maichou adu” haina iri</char></note> amata Galilee-dagi thorakte haibasi nahakna khanggani.”<verse eid="JHN 7:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Adudagi mi khudingmak magi magi mayumda hannakhre.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Nupaga oktaba lichat chatlubagi pharaba nupi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Adubu Jisudi Olives chingda chatlammi. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Ayuk anganbada Ibungona Mapugi Sanglenda amuk hanna chatlammi maduda mi pumnamakna Ibungogi akoibada tillammi aduga Ibungona phamthaduna makhoida tambiba hourammi. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Ibungona asum tambiringeida Wayel Yathanggi ojasing amadi Pharisee-singna nupaga oktaba lichat chatlingeimaktada pharabi nupi amabu Ibungogi manakta puraktuna miyam mamangda lep-halle, <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>aduga makhoina Ibungoda hairak-i, “Oja, nupi asi nupaga oktaba lichat chatlingeimaktada pharakpani. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Levi 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Aniwa 22:22-24</ref></char></note>Eikhoigi Wayel Yathangda Moses-na asigumba nupidi nungna thaduna hatkadabani haina yathang pirammi masida nahak kari haining-i?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Ibungobu maral siba yaba yumpham phangnanaba makhoina wahang asina laanggumna sijinnabani. Adubu Ibungona nontharaga khudombina leimaigi uphunda i-ba hourammi. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Maduda makhoina makha tana paokhum piraknaba asum hanglaklabada Ibungona nongkhatlaklaga makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoigi narakta pap toudaba mahak aduna nupi asida ihan hanna nungna thasanu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Adudagi Ibungona amuk nontharaga leimaigi uphunda ire. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Masi tabada, ahansingdagi houraga amamam oina makhoi loina chatkhre. Mahakki mangda leptuna leiribi nupi aduga Ibungo Jisu khaktaga ngaihoure. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Maduda Ibungona nongkhatlaktuna nupi aduda hairak-i, “Nahakpu naran siramba makhoising adu kadaida chatkhre? Kana amatana nahakpu lalhandrabra?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Nupi aduna khumlak-i, “Ibungo, kana amatana eibu lalhandre.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Maduda Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Einasu nahakpu lalhandre. Chatlu, pap amuk touraganu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Taibangpan-gi mangal oiriba Jisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Jisuna makhoida amuk hairak-i, “Eidi taibangpan-gi mangalni. Kanagumbana eigi itung illabadi mahak keidoungeidasu amambada chatlaroi adubu hingbagi mangal adu mahakna phangjagani.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:31">Jn 5:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pharisee-singna singnaraduna Ibungoda hairak-i, “Nahak nasana nasagi maramda sakhi pijare. Adugumba sakhi adu chatnaba yade.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Eina isagi maramda sakhi pirabasu eina haidokliba adu achumbani maramdi ei kadaidagi lakpano aduga ei kadaida chatlibano haiba eihakna khang-i. Adubu nakhoinadi ei kadaidagi lakpano aduga ei kadaida chatlibano haiba khangde. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Mioibana wayenba ma-ongda nakhoina wayelli adubu eina mi kana amatabu wayende. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Adubu eina wayellabadi eigi wayel adu achumbani maramdi ei ithanta natte adubu eibu thabirakpa Ipa adu eiga loinari. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Aniwa 19:15</ref></char></note>Mi anigi sakhidi achumbani haina nakhoigi wayel yathangda iduna leiri. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Eina eigi isagi maramda sakhi pi aduga eigi maramda sakhi pibiba atoppa adudi eibu thabirakpa Ipa aduni.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Adudagi makhoina Ibungoda hanglak-i, “Nahakki napabu kadaida leibage?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Nakhoina eibusu eigi Ipabusu khangde. Nakhoina eibu khanglamlabadi eigi Ipabusu nakhoina khanglamgadabani.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Senkhai happa upusing thamba Mapugi Sanglen-gi ka aduda waphamsing asi Jisuna tambiringeida haibani. Adubu Ibungogi pungpham adu laktriba maramna Ibungobu kana amatana phaba-punba touramde.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eina chatpa mapham aduda nakhoina lakpa ngamloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Jisuna makhoida amuksu hairak-i, “Eidi chatkhragani. Nakhoina eibu thigani adubu nakhoidi nakhoigi papta sigani. Eina chatpa mapham aduda nakhoina lakpa ngamloi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Maram aduna Jihudigi luchingbasing aduna hairak-i, “‘Eina chatpa mapham aduda nakhoi lakpa ngamloi’ haina mahakna hairibasi mahak masa matomta sijagadouribra?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Jisuna makha tana makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoidi makhadagini adubu eidi mathaktagini. Nakhoidi taibangpan asidagini adubu eidi taibangpan asidagi natte. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Maram asinani nakhoina nakhoigi papta sigani haina eina nakhoida haikhiba adu. Eihakti eina hairiba mahak aduni haiba nakhoina thajadrabadi nakhoi nakhoigi papta sijagani.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Adudagi makhoina Ibungoda hanglak-i, “Nahak kanano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Maduda Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i, “Hek houbadi eina nakhoida haiduna lakkhiba mahak adumakni. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Nakhoigi maramda eina nakhoida haiba yaba amadi nakhoibu wayenba yaba mayam ama lei adubu ei madu touroi. Eibu thabirakpa Ibungo mahak adudi achumbani aduga eidi Ibungo mangondagi taba taba adukhakta eina taibangpanda haidok-i.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Jisuna Mapa Ibungo adugi maramda haibani haibasi makhoina khanglamde. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Maram asina Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoina Migi Machanupa adubu thanggatpa matamda eihakti eina hairiba mahak adumakni haiba nakhoina khanggani. Aduga ei isa ithantana karisu toude adubu Ipa aduna eingonda takpi takpiba adukhakta eina hai haibasi nakhoina khanggani <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Eibu thabirakpa Ibungo mahak adu eiga loinari; mahakna eibu itompta thadokpide maramdi Ibungo mahakpu pelhanba thabaksing eina matam pumbada tou-i.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Ibungona haiba wasing asi taba mi mayam amana Ibungobu thajare.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Achumbana nakhoibu ningtamhanbigani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Ibungo Jisubu thajaraba makhoising aduda Jisuna hairak-i, “Eina tambiba adu nakhoina itattattana illabadi tasengnamak nakhoi eigi tung-inbasingni. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Adu oirabadi nakhoina achumba adu khanggani amadi achumba aduna nakhoibu ningtamhanbigani.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mat 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:8">Luk 3:8</ref></char>
    </note>Maduda makhoina khumlak-i, “Eikhoidi Abraham-gi charol suronni aduga eikhoina kanagumba mi amatagi minai oikhidri. ‘Nakhoibu ningtamhanbigani’ haina nahakna karamna hairibano?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i, “Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, pap touba mi khudingmak papki minaini. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Minaidi imung aduda matam pumbagi oina leite adubu machanupa adudi matam pumbagi oina lei. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Machanupa aduna nakhoibu ningtamhanbirabadi, nakhoi tasengnamak ningtamgani. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Nakhoi Abraham-gi charol suronni haiba ei khang-i. Adubu nakhoina eibu hatnaba hotnari maramdi nakhoigi thamoinungda eigi waheigi mapham leite. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Eina Ipaga loinana leiringeida ukhraba adu eina nakhoida hairi. Adubu nakhoidi nakhoigi napana haiba adu tou-i.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Maduda makhoina khumlak-i, “Eikhoigi ipadi Abraham-ni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoi Abraham-gi machasing oiramlabadi mahakna toukhiba thabaksing adu nakhoina touramgadabani. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Eina Tengban Mapudagi taraba achumba adu nakhoida hairi aduga nakhoina eibu hatnaba hotnari. Madugumba thabak adu Abraham-di khak toukhide. <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Nakhoidi nakhoigi napa aduna touba adu nakhoina touribani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Maduda makhoina khumlak-i, “Eikhoidi chatnabi kaina pokpa machasing natte, eikhoigi Ipa amakhakta lei mahak adudi Tengban Mapuni.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Tengban Mapubu nakhoigi napa Ibungomak oiramlabadi nakhoina eibu nungsiramgadabani maramdi eihak Ibungo mangondagi lakpani aduga houjik ei mapham asida leire. Ei isana iranai oina mapham asida lakpa natte adubu Ibungo mahakna eibu thabirakpani. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Eina hairibasi nakhoina karigi wakhal taba ngamdribano? Masigi maramdi eina haiba nakhoina lousinba ngamdabagini. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Nakhoidi nakhoigi napa Satan-gi machasingni, nakhoina napagi apambasing touba pammi. Mahakti ahoubadagi mihatpa oire aduga mangonda achumba leitaba maramna mahak achumbada lepte. Mahakna minamba ngangba matamda mahakki mahousagi oiba adu ngangbani maramdi mahakti minamba ngangbani aduga minamba pumnamakki mapani. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Adubu eina achumba adu ngangba maramna nakhoina eibu thajade. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Nakhoigi naraktagi kanagumba amana eibu pap toubagi maral lei haiba utpa ngamgadra? Eina achumba adu hairabada nakhoina eibu thajadriba karigino? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Tengban Mapugi oiba mina Tengban Mapugi wasing tai. Adubu nakhoidi Tengban Mapugi oidaba maramna nakhoina tadabani.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu amadi Abraham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Makhoina Jisuda hanglak-i, “Nahakti Samaria-gi mini aduga nangonda lai phattaba chang-i haina eikhoina haibasi chumlaba nattra?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Eingonda lai phattaba changde. Eidi eigi Ipabu ikai khumnei aduga nakhoinadi eibu ikai khumnade. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Eina isabu ikai khumnanaba thide adubu eibu ikai khumnahanba pamba kanagumba ama lei mahakti wayen toubani. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, kanagumbana eigi wa illabadi mahak keidoungeidasu siraroi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Maduda makhoina Ibungoda hairak-i, “Nangonda lai phattaba sungsoi soidana changle haibasi houjikti eikhoi khangle. Abraham sikhi aduga Mapu Ibungogi wa phongdokpa maichousingsu sikhi adubu nahaknadi ‘Kanagumbana eigi wa illabadi mahak keidoungeidasu siraroi’ haina hairi. <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Nahakna eikhoigi ipa Abraham-dagi henna chaobra? Mahak sikhi aduga Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichousingsu sikhi. Nahak nasasi kanani haina khanjaribano?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Jisuna khumlak-i, “Ei isana ithantabu thagatcharabadi eigi thagatchaba adu karisu natte. Adubu eibu thagatpibadi nakhoina nakhoigi Tengban Mapuni haijariba adu eigi Ipa adunani. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Nakhoinadi Ibungo mahakpu khangde adubu einadi mahakpu khang-i. Eina Ibungo mahakpu khangde hairabadi eisu nakhoigumna minamba ngangba mi ama oiramgadabani. Adubu eidi Ibungo mahakpu khang-i aduga mahakki wa illi. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Eina lakkadabagi numit adu ugani khallubada nakhoigi napa ibungo Abraham yamna haraojakhi, madu mahakna ujakhi amadi nungaijakhi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Maduda makhoina Ibungoda hairak-i, “Chahi yangkhei phaoba sudriba nahakna Abraham-bu ukhraba!”<verse eid="JHN 8:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Jisuna khumlak-i, “Eina nakhoida tasengna hairiba asini, Abraham poktringei mamangda ei leirabani.”<verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Maram aduna makhoina Ibungoda thananaba nung paikhatle. Adubu Ibungona mahak masabu lotlaga makhoigi marak phaoduna Mapugi Sanglendagi chatkhre.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Pokpadagi mit tanglaba mi amabu Jisuna phahanbiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Jisuna asum chatlingeida pokpadagi mit tanglaklaba nupa ama urammi. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Maduda Ibungogi tung-inbasingna Ibungoda hanglak-i, “Oja Ibungo, kanana pap toubagi nupa asi mit tangna poklibano? Mahakna pap toubagira nattraga mahakki mama mapana pap toubagira?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Mahakna nattraga mahakki mama mapana pap toubagi natte adubu Tengban Mapugi panggalna mahakki punsida thabak toubiba adu unanabani. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Numit leiringeida eibu thabirakpa Ibungo mahakki thabak eikhoina touba tai. Kana amatana thabak touba ngamloidaba ahing adu lakli. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mat 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Jn 8:12</ref></char></note>Eina taibangpanda leiringeida, ei taibangpan-gi mangalni.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Ibungona masi hairaba matungda leimaida tin sitle aduga tin aduna leikhom semlaga nupa adugi mitta madu teibire <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>aduga Ibungona nupa aduda hairak-i, “Siloam-gi pukhrida chatlaga chamthoklu.” (Siloam haibagi wahanthokti “Thakhraba” haibani). Maram aduna nupa aduna chattuna chamthoklure aduga mahakki mit uba phangjaraga hallakle.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Mahakki yumlon keironnabasing amadi mahakna chakniba oiringeida ukhibasingna hainarak-i, “Phamduna chakniramba nupa adubu asi nattra?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Kharana hairak-i, “Nupa asini” adubu khara amana amuk hairak-i, “Nupa asi natte masak manabani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Maduda nupa aduna hairak-i, “Ei mahak adumakni.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Maram aduna makhoina mangonda hanglak-i, “Adudi nahak kamdouna uba ngamlaklibano?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Mahakna khumlak-i, “Jisu kouba nupa amana leikhom semlaga eigi mitta teibire aduga Siloam pukhrida chatlaga chamthoklunaba eingonda haibi. Madu eina chattuna chamthoklubada ei uba ngamlakpani.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Maduda makhoina mangonda hanglak-i, “Mahak houjik kadaida leibage?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Mahakna khumlak-i, “Ei khangjade.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pharisee-singna anaba phaba adugi maramda thigatpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Adudagi makhoina mit tanglamba nupa adu Pharisee-singgi manakta purakle. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Jisuna leikhom semduna nupa adubu mit tangbadagi phahanbikhiba numit adu Potthaba numit oirammi. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Maram aduna Pharisee-singnasu mahak kamdouna mit uba ngamkhibage haina amuk hanglammi. Maduda mahakna khumlak-i, “Mahakna eigi mitta leikhom haple aduga eina madu chamthokpada ei uba phanglakpani.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Maduda Pharisee kharana hairak-i, “Madu touriba nupa adu Tengban Mapudagi oiroi maramdi mahak potthaba numit ngakte.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Adubu mi kharana hairak-i, “Pap chenba mi amana karamna asigumba angakpa khudamsing asi touba ngamgadouribano?” Asumna makhoi masel tokhai tanare.<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Maram aduna Pharisee-singna nupa aduda amukkasu hanglak-i, “Nahakki mit uhalliba mi adugi maramda nahak kari haining-i?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Nupa aduna khumlak-i, “Mahak asi Mapu Ibungogi wa phongdokpa maichou amani haina eina khanjei.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Jihudigi luchingbasingna nupa asi hanna mit tanglammi aduga konna uba phanglakpani haibasi makhoina thajaramde maram asina makhoina nupa adugi mama mapa koure <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>aduga makhoida hanglak-i, “Nakhoina pokpadagi mit tanglak-i haiba nachanupa adu mahak asira? Aduga kamdouna mahak houjik uba ngamlibano?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Nupa adugi mama mapa aduna khumlak-i, “Mahak eikhoigi ichanupani aduga mahak pokpadagi mit tanglak-i haiba eikhoi khangjei. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Adubu kamdouna mahak uba ngamlakkhibano aduga kanana mahakpu mit tangba phahanbiribano haibasidi eikhoi khangjade. Mangonda hangbiyu, mahak chahi yamlabani. Mahak masana paokhum pijasanu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Jihudigi luchingbasing adubu kibadagi makhoina asumna haibani maramdi Jisubu Christtani haina haidokchabasing adu synagogue-tagi tanthokkani haina hanana makhoina warep lepnakhre. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Maram adunani “Mahak chahi yamlabani. Mahak masana paokhum pijasanu.” haina makhoina hairibani.<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Aniraksuba oina makhoina mit tanglamba nupa adu kouraga hairak-i, “Tengban Mapuda matik mangal piyu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Achumba ngangnaba haiba </char></note> nahakpu phahanba mi asi pap chenba mini haiba eikhoina khang-i.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Maduda nupa aduna khumlak-i, “Mahak pap chenba nattraga chendaba mira haibadi ei khangjade. Asimatangdi ei khangjei madudi ei mit tanglammi adubu houjik ei uba phangjare.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Adudagi makhoina mangonda hairak-i, “Mahakna nangonda kari toukhi? Aduga kamdouna mahakna nahakki mit u-hankhibano?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Nupa aduna khumlak-i, “Eina nakhoida hanna haikhre adubu nakhoina tade. Aduga karigi nakhoina amuk hanna taninglibano? Nakhoisu mahakki tung-inba mising oiba pamlibra?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Maduda makhoina mahakpu ikaiba piraduna hairak-i, “Nahakti mahakki tung-inba mini adubu eikhoidi Moses-ki tung-inba misingni! <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Moses-ta Tengban Mapuna wa ngangbi haiba eikhoina khang-i adubu nupa asidi kadaidagi lakpano haiba phaoba eikhoi khangde.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Nupa aduna khumlak-i, “Madudi angakpani! Mahak kadaidagi lakpano haiba nakhoina khangde adubu mahakna eigi mit uhanbire. <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Pap chenbasinggi haijabadi Tengban Mapuna tabide haiba eikhoi khang-i. Adubu Ibungo mahakpu khurumjaba amadi mahakki aningba toubasinggi haijabadi tabi. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Pokpadagi mit tanglakpa mi amabu uhanbiba haibasi taibangpan houbadagi kana amatana tadri. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Nupa asi Tengban Mapudagi oiramdrabadi mahakna karisu touba ngamlamloi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Makhoina mangonda khumlak-i. “Papna yomlaga poklakpa nangna kari natik leiduna eikhoibu tambiriba?” Adudagi makhoina mahakpu synagogue-tagi tanthokkhre.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thawaigi oiba mit tangba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Makhoina mahakpu tanthokkhre haiba Jisuna tare aduga Ibungona mahakpu thengnarabada mangonda hanglak-i, “Nahak Migi Machanupa adubu thajabra?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Nupa aduna khumlak-i, “Ibungo, mahak adu kanano? Eina mahakpu thajanaba Ibungona eingonda takpiyu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Nahakna mahakpu hanana ukhre, mahak adudi nangonda houjik wari sariba mahak aduni.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Nupa aduna hairak-i, “Mapu Ibungo, ei thajei.” Aduga mahakna Jisubu khurumjarammi.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Maduda Jisuna hairak-i, “Wayennabagidamak ei taibangpan asida lakpani aduna mit tangbasingna unanaba aduga mit ubasingna tangnanabani.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Ibungogi manakta leiramba Pharisee kharana hairiba adu tarabada makhoina Ibungoda hairak-i, “Nahakna hairibasi eikhoi mit tang-i hairibra?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Nakhoi mit tanglamlabadi nakhoida papki naral leiramloidabani adubu nakhoina ui haina haijarabanina nakhoida papki naral leire.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yaosenbagi pandam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Jisuna hairak-i, “Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, thongdagi changdaduna atoppa maphamdagi karaga yaokonda changba mi adu huranba amadi migi mapot munba mini. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Adubu thongdagi yaokonda changba mi adudi yaosing adugi yaosenbani. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Thongngakpa aduna mahakkidamak thong adu hangdokpi aduga yaosing aduna mahakki khonjel tai. Mahakna mahakki yaosing adubu maming panduna koubi aduga mahakna makhoibu yaokon adugi mapanda chingbi. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>Mahakki yaosing adubu mapanda puthokpiba matamda mahakna makhoigi mang thaduna chatli aduga makhoina mahakki matung illi maramdi makhoina mahakki khonjel khang-i. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Makhoina mitop amagi matung khak illoi madugi mahutta makhoina mitop adudagi chenkhigani maramdi makhoina mitopsinggi khonjel khangde.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Jisuna makhoida pandam asi haibire adubu Ibungona makhoida kari haininglibano haibadudi makhoina wakhal taba ngamlamde.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisudi aphaba yaosenbani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Maram asina Jisuna makhoida amuk hairak-i, “Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, yaosing adugi thong adu eini. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Eigi mangda lakkhiba makhoi pumnamak huranba amadi migi mapot munba mi ngaktani aduga yaosing aduna makhoigi khonjel tade. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Thong adu eini. Eigi ipanna changlakpa mi khudingmak kanbigani. Makhoina changthok changsin tougani amadi sanjabung phangjagani. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Huranba aduna lakpadi hurannanaba, hatnanaba amadi mang-hantak-hannanabata lakpani. Adubu eina lakpadi makhoina hingba phangnanaba aduga hingba adu marang kaina phangnanaba lakpani.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>“Aphaba yaosenba adu eini. Aphaba yaosenba aduna yaosinggidamak thawai thabi. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Anekpa mi haibadi yaosing adu masagi nattaba adunadi keisal lakpa ubada yaosing adu thadoklamlaga chenkhi. Aduga keisal aduna yaosing adubu laktuna phai amadi chaikhai. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Anekpa mi aduna chenkhibagi maramdi mahak anekpani aduga mahakna yaosing adugidamak karisu thousade. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14-15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mat 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luk 10:22</ref></char></note>Aphaba yaosenba adu eini. Eigi Ipana eibu khangbiba amadi eina Ipabu khangjaba adugumna eina eigi yaosingbu khang-i aduga eigi yaosingna eibu khang-i. Amasung eina yaosinggidamak thawai thabi. <verse eid="JHN 10:14-15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Yaokon asida leitaba eigi atei yaosingsu leiri. Eina makhoibusu purakpa tai. Makhoinasu eigi khonjel tagani aduga yaosenba ama leiba yao sanggu ama oirakkani.<verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>“Eigi Ipana eibu nungsi maramdi eina eigi thawaibu amuk hanna lousinnaba eina thawai thai. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Kana amatana eingondagi eigi thawai louba natte. Ei isana yana thawai thabani. Eina eigi thawai thaba amadi amuk lousinbagi itik eingonda lei. Yathang asi eigi Ipadagi phangjabani.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Ibungona haiba waheising asigi maramna Jihudisinggi marakta amuk tokhai tanare. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Makhoi mayam amana hairak-i, “Mahak lai phattaba changba amadi angaoba mini. Mahakki wabu karigi eikhoina tagadouribano?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Adubu atoppa kharana amuk hairak-i, “Masi lai phattaba changba mi amana nganggadaba wahei natte. Lai phattabanabu mit tangba migi mitpu uhanba ngamgadra?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu yadaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Matam adu ningthamthagi matam oirammi, Jerusalem-da Mapugi Sanglen katthokpagi chakkhangba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Hanukkah” hainasu khangnei </char></note> numit adu lakle. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Mapugi Sanglen aduda Solomon-gi hojang kouba mapham aduda Jisuna chattuna leirammi. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Maduda Jihudisingna Ibungogi akoibada koisillaklaga hairak-i, “Nahakna eikhoibu kayam kuina chingnahanduna thamgadouribano? Nahak Christta adu oirabadi eikhoida sengna haiyu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i, “Eina nakhoida hanna haikhre adubu nakhoina eibu thajade. Eina Ipagi mingda touba thabaksing aduna eigi maramda khang-halli. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Adubu nakhoina eibu thajade maramdi nakhoi eigi yaosing natte. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Eigi yaosingdi eigi khonjel tai; eina makhoibu khang-i aduga makhoina eigi itung illi. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Eina makhoida lomba naidaba hingba pibi aduga makhoi keidoungeidasu siraroi. Kana amatana makhoibu eigi khuttagi munba ngamloi. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Makhoibu eingonda pibiriba eigi Ipa aduna pumnamaktagi chaoba helli. Kana amatana makhoibu Ipagi khuttagi munba ngamloi. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Eiga Ipaga amatani.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Adudagi Jihudisingna Ibungoda thanaba nung amuk khun-gatlammi. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Eigi Ipana eingonda tounaba pibiba aphaba thabak mayam ama eina nakhoigi mangda toukhre. Thabaksing adugi maraktagi karamba thabakkidamak nakhoina eibu nungna thagadouribano?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 24:16">Levi 24:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Makhoina khumlak-i, “Nahakna touba aphaba thabaksing adugidamak eikhoina nahakpu nungna thagadaba natte adubu nahakna Tengban Mapubu thina ngangbagini. Nahakna mi ama oiraga nasabu Mapu Ibungoni haijari.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 82:6">Isei 82:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Maduda Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i, “Nakhoigi wayel yathangda asumna iduna leiba nattra madudi Ishworna hai, ‘Nakhoi mapu ibungosingni?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Eikhoina khang-i adudi Mapugi puyadi kaiba yade. Maram asina Ishworna mahakki wahei pibiba makhoisingbu ‘ishworsing’ haina haibire. <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Eigi oinadi, Ipana eibu khandokpibani amadi taibangpan asida thabirakpani. Adu oiragadi ‘Ei Tengban Mapugi Machanupani’ haina eina haibasida kamdouna Mapu Ibungobu thina ngang-i haina nakhoina hairibano? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Eina Ipagi thabaksing adu toudrabadi eibu thajaganu. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Adubu eina Ipagi thabaksing adu tourabadi nakhoina eibu thajadrabasu, Ipana eingonda lei aduga eina Ipada lei haibasi nakhoina khang-nanaba amadi thajananaba thabaksing adubudi thajou.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Amuk hanna makhoina Ibungobu phananaba hotnarammi adubu Ibungona makhoigi makhuttagi nanthokle.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:28">Jn 1:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Adudagi Jisuna Jordan wangmada chatlammi aduga John-na i-han hanna baptize touramba mapham aduda leire <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>aduga mi mayam amana Ibungogi maphamda laklammi. Maduda makhoi masel hainarak-i, “John-di angakpa thabak amatadi toukhide adubu mahakna mi asigi maramda haikhiba pumnamak adudi achumbani.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Mapham aduda mi mayam amana Ibungobu thajare.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Lazarus siba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:38">Luk 10:38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:39">39</ref></char>
    </note>Lazarus kouba nupa ama naduna leirammi. Mahakti mache Mary amadi Martha-ga loinana Bethany khunggangda leibani. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:3">Jn 12:3</ref></char></note>Lazarus-ki mache Mary asi Mapu Ibungogi makhongda manam nungsiba thao heiduna masamna teithokkhiba nupi aduni. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Machem ani asina Jisuda pao asumna tharammi, “Ibungo, nahakna nungsijaba marup adu nare.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Jisuna pao asi tabada hairak-i, “Anaba asi siraga loisin-gadaba anaba natte adubu Tengban Mapugi matik mangal oinanaba amadi masigi mapanna Tengban Mapugi Machanupa adubu matik mangal phangnanabani.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Martha, mahakki manaonupi amadi Lazarus-pu Jisuna nungsijarammi. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Adubu Ibungona Lazarus nare haiba tabada Ibungona leiriba mapham aduda numit nini amaga amuk makha tana leitharammi. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Adudagi Ibungona mahakki tung-inbasingda hairak-i, “Eikhoi Judea-da hallasi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Maduda Ibungogi tung-inbasingna khumlak-i, “Oja Ibungo, mapham aduda Jihudisingna Ibungobu nungna thanaba hotnakhibadu ikui kuikhidri aduga Ibungona mapham aduda amuk chatke hairibra?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Jisuna khumlak-i, “Nongmada pung taranithoi nungthil oiba nattra? Nungthilda chatpa mi amana khudi thide maramdi taibangpan asigi mangalna mahakna uba phang-i. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Adubu numidangda chatpa mahak adudi khudi thi maramdi mangonda mangal leite.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Masi hairaba tungda Ibungona makhoida makha tana hairak-i, “Eikhoigi marup Lazarus tumkhre adubu mahak houdoknaba ei houjik chatkani.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Maduda tung-inbasing aduna khumlak-i, “Ibungo, mahak tumlabadi, mahak naba pharagani.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Jisuna hainingba adudi Lazarus sire haibani adubu makhoinadi Ibungona hairibadu tumduna potthabagi maramda haibani haina khallammi. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Maram aduna Jisuna makhoida sengna haibire, “Lazarus sire, <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>nakhoina thajanaba eina mahakka loinana mapham aduda leiminnaramdaba asi nakhoigidamak ei harao-i. Eikhoi mahakki manakta chatlasi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Didymus<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wahanthokti “Phaibok” haibani.</char></note> hainasu kouba Thomas-na mahakka loinariba tung-inbasing aduda hairak-i, “Ibungoga loinana siminnanaba eikhoisu chatlasi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisudi hinggatpa amadi hingba aduni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Jisuna Bethany-da thunglaba matamda Lazarus leirol chankhiba numit marini sukhre. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Bethany asi Jerusalem-dagi mile animuk lapna leibani. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Jihudi mayam amana Martha amadi Mary-gi manakta makhoigi moupuwa leikhidaba adugi themjinbinaba laklammi.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Jisu lakle tabada Martha-na Ibungobu unanaba thoklammi adubu Mary-di yumda leihourammi. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Martha-na Jisuda hairak-i, “Ibungo, nahakna mapham asida leiramlabadi eigi ipuwa adu siramloidabani. <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Adubu houjikmaksu Ibungona nijaba khudingmak Tengban Mapuna pibigani haiba ei khangjei.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Nahakki noupuwa amuk hinggatkani.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Maduda Martha-na khumlak-i, “Aroiba numit aduda mahak amuk hinggatkani haibasi ei khangjei.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Hinggatpa amadi hingba adu eini. Eibu thajaba mahak adu sirabasu hinggani. <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>Eingonda leiba aduga eibu thajaba mi khudingna keidoungeidasu siraroi. Nahak masi thajabra?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Maduda Martha-na khumlak-i, “Hoi, Ibungo. Ibungodi taibangpanda lengbirakkadaba Tengban Mapugi Machanupa, Christta aduni haiba ei thajei.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna kappa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Martha-na masi hairaba tungda mahakna mahakki manaonupi Mary-gi manakta chatlammi aduga mahakpu tonganna kouthoklaga hairak-i, “Mapham asida Oja lak-le, nahakpu hangli.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Mary-na masi tabada thunamak hougattuna Ibungobu unanaba chatlammi. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Jisudi khunggang aduda youraktri adubu Martha-na unaramba mapham aduda adumak leirammi. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Yum aduda Mary-bu themjinbiramba Jihudising aduna mahakna yamna thuna hougattuna chatkhiba adu ubada, mahak Lazarus-ki mongphamda kappa chatlibani haina khanduna makhoina mahakki matung illammi.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Jisuna leiriba mapham aduda Mary-na thunglabada mahakna Ibungobu ujare aduga Ibungogi khuyakhada tuthajaraga hairak-i, “Ibungo, nahakna mapham asida leiramlabadi eigi ipuwa adu siramloidabani.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Mahakna kappa amasung mahakka loinariba Jihudising aduna kappa adu ubada Ibungogi thamoi soklammi amadi yamna nungaitaba phaorammi. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>“Nakhoina mahakpu kadaida leirol chankhibage?” haina Ibungona makhoida hanglammi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Maduda makhoina khumlak-i, “Ibungo, lakpiduna yengbiyu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Jisu kaplammi. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Maduda Jihudisingna hairak-i, “Yeng-u, mahakna Lazarus-pu kayada nungsiriba!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Adubu mi kharanadi asumna hairak-i, “Mit tangba mibudi uhanba ngamlaga mahakna Lazarus-pudi sihandana thambadi ngamdabra?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lazarus-pu sibadagi hinggat-hanba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Amuk hanna yamna nungaitaba phaoraduna Jisuna mongpham aduda laklammi. Mongpham adu nungjao amana changphamda thingjinduna thamba surung amani. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Nung adu louthokkhoǃ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Leikhidraba nupa adugi mache Martha-na Ibungoda hairak-i, “Ibungo, manam namthiramlagani maramdi mahak mapham aduda thamkhiba numit marini sukhre.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Maduda Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Nahakna thajarabadi nahak Tengban Mapugi matik mangal uba phanggani haina eina nangonda haikhiba nattra?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Maram aduna makhoina nung adu louthokkhre. Adudagi Jisuna swargaromda yengkhatlaga hairak-i, “Ipa, eina haijaba Ibungona tabibagi thagatchari. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Matam pumnamakta eina haijaba Ibungona tabi haiba eina khangjei adubu Ibungona eibu thabirakpani haiba mapham asida leiriba miyamsing asina thajananaba makhoigidamak eina khon thokna haidokchabani.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Masi hairaba tungda Ibungona ahouba khonjelna laorak-i, “Lazarus, thoklak-u!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Maduda mahakki makhong makhuttu phumbada sijinnaba phi masangsingna yetsillammi aduga mamaidu phi amana yetlaga thoklakle. Maduda Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Pulliba mongphamgi phising adu louthok-u aduga mahak chatchasanu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu hatnaba thourang touba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mrk 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luk 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Mary-gi manakta lakpa Jihudi mayam ama Jisuna toukhiba thabak adu urammi aduga makhoina Ibungobu thajare. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Adubu makhoi kharanadi Pharisee-singgi manakta chatlaga Jisuna toukhiba thabak adu tamle. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Maram aduna Pharisee-sing amadi athoiba purohitsingna Sanhedrin-gi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mioi 71 na saba Jihudisinggi khwaidagi matik leiba wayellup</char></note> mitin ama koure. Maduda makhoi masel hangnarak-i, “Eikhoi kari tousige? Mi asina touriba angakpa thabak pumnamak asi yeng-u. <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Eikhoina mahakpu asumna thadoklabadi mi khudingna mahakpu thajakhragani madu oirabadi Rome-gi misingna laktuna eikhoigi Mapu Sanglen amadi eikhoigi phurup asi loukhragani.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Makhoigi maraktagi Caiaphas kouba chahi adugi Purohitlen oiba mahakna hairak-i, “Nakhoi karisu khangde! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Phurup apumba amabu pummang mangbagi mahutta mi amana miyamgidamak sibibana nakhoigidamak henna phei haibasi nakhoi khangdabra?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Masi mahakna masagi aningbadagi haiba natte adubu mahakna chahi adugi Purohitlen ama oina Jihudi phurupkidamak Jisuna sibigani haina Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpani, <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>madu Jihudi phurup khaktagi nattana chaithoktuna leiriba Tengban Mapugi machasingbu khomjinduna amata oihannanabani.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Numit adudagi Jihudigi luchingbasingna Jisubu hatnanaba thourang touba houre. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Maram aduna Jisuna Jihudisinggi marakta phongna chattre. Madugi mahutta lamjao lamhangda manakta leiba Ephraim kouba khun amada chatlammi aduga mapham aduda mahakki tung-inbasingga loinana leirammi.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Jihudisinggi oiba Lanthokpibagi Chakkhangba adugi matam naksillaklabada, lam adugi miyamna Chakkhangba adugi mang-oinana laininggi oiba sengdoknabagidamak Jerusalem-da chatlammi. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Makhoina Jisubu thirammi aduga makhoina Ningnasangda lepna lepna makhoi masel amaga amaga hangnarak-i, “Nakhoi kari khalli? Mahaksibu Chakkhangba asida lakloidra?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Athoiba purohitsing amadi pharisee-singna Jisubu phananabagidamak, kanagumbana Jisubu kadaida leibage haiba khanglabadi mahakna pao pirakkadabani haina yathang pirammi.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Bethany-da Jisugi khongda thao heiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mrk 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Lanthokpibagi chakkhangba hougadaba numit taruknigi mamangda, Jisuna sibadagi hinggat-hanbikhiba Lazarus-na leiba mapham Bethany-da Jisuna laklammi. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Jisugidamak numidanggi chaklen ama langlammi maduda Martha-na chana-thaknabagi semsabagi thougal adu tourammi aduga Ibungoga loinana phamminnaribasinggi marakta Lazarus yaorammi. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37">Luk 7:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char></note>Adudagi Mary-na mamal atangba asengba nard-ki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nard: Himalay chingsanggi lamdamsingda houba manam nungsiba thao amadi mahi semnaba pambi ama.</char></note> manam nungsiba mahi litre makhaimuk oigadaba ama puraktuna Jisugi khongda heirammi aduga mahakki masamna Ibungogi khong teithoklammi. Maduda yum adu nungsiba manam aduna pumthal thallammi. <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Adubu Jisugi tung-inba ama oiriba aduga Jisubu konna pithokkadouriba Judas Iscariot-na yaningdana hairak-i, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>“Chahi amagi khutsuman oigadaba manam nungsiba thao asi yollaga senpham adu lairabasingda pidriba karigino?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Mahakna masi haibasi lairabasinggi khanbadagi haiba natte adubu mahak huranba mi ama oibagi maramnani. Mahak sen-gao panaba ama oiraga mahakna sen-gao aduda haplakpa sel adu hek hek sijinnathok-i.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Maduda Jisuna hairak-i, “Mangonda ayetpa piganu! Masi eihakpu leirol chan-gadaba numit adugidamak mahakna khaktuna thamlibani. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Aniwa 15:11</ref></char></note>Lairabasingdi nakhoigi narakta matam pumbada leigani adubu eidi nakhoiga matam pumnamakta leigadaba natte.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lazarus-pu hatnaba thourang touba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Yamlaba Jihudi miyam amana Bethany-da Jisu leire haiba tarabada makhoina Jisugi maram khaktagi nattana Ibungona sibadagi hinggat-hanbikhraba Lazarus-pusu yengnaba laklammi. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Maram aduna athoiba purohitsingna Lazarus-pusu hatnaba thourang tourammi, <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>maramdi mahakki maramdagi Jihudi mayam amana makhoibu thadoklamlaga Jisuda thajaba thamle.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna mai pakna Jerusalem-da changba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mrk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Mathanggi numitta Lanthokpibagi Chakkhangba aduda laklamba yamkhraba miyam amana Jisuna Jerusalem tamna lakli haiba tarammi. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Isei 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char></note>Maram aduna makhoina thangtup pambigi masasing puduna Ibungobu okpa chatlammi aduga makhoina laorak-i, “Hosanna!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hosanna: Hebrew wahei asi handokpada eikhoibu kanbiyu haibani adubu matam aduda wahei asi Ishwor thagatpagi wahei oina sijinnarammi.</char></note> MAPU IBUNGO-gi mingda lenglakliba mahak adu yaiphabani! Israel-gi Ningthou adu yaiphabani!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Jisuna lola ama phangladuna mathakta tongkhatlammi, Mapugi puyada asumna ikhibagumbani:<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>“Kiganu, he Zion-gi sahar!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Yeng-u nahakki ningthou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">lola macha ama tongduna lakli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Matam aduda Ibungogi tung-inbasingna waram asi khangba ngamlamde. Adubu Jisubu matik mangal phang-hallaba matungda hairibasing asi Ibungo mahakki maramda ibani aduga makhoina masising asi Ibungoda toubani haiba ningsinglakkhi.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Ibungona Lazarus-pu mongphamdagi kouthoktuna asibadagi hinggat-hankhiba matamda Ibungoga loinakhiba mising aduna thoudok adugi matangda koisan sandoklammi. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Mi mayam amana Ibungobu unanaba hotnarammi maramdi Ibungona toukhiba angakpa khudam adugi matangda tarammi. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Pharisee-singna makhoi masel amaga amaga asumna hainarak-i, “Khangledana, eikhoi karisu touba ngamdre haibasi. Yeng-u, taibangpan asigi mi pumnamakna mahakki matung inkhre!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Greek-ki mi kharana Jisubu thijaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Chakkhangba aduda Mapu Ibungobu khurumjanaba Jerusalem-da chatpasing adugi marakta Greek-ki mi kharasu yaorammi. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Galilee-gi Bethsaida hairiba mapham asidagi lakpa nupa Philip-ki maphamda makhoina laklaga hairak-i, “Ibungo, eikhoi Jisubu unajaba pamjei.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Maduda Philip-na chattuna Andrew-da tamlure aduga makhoi anina chattuna Jisuda tamle. <verse eid="JHN 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i, “Migi Machanupa adu matik mangal chaohan-gadaba pungpham adu lakle. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, gehu maru amana leipakta taraga sidrabadi madu maru ama oina adum leigani. Adubu maru aduna sirabadi mahei yamna yan-gani. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mrk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref></char></note>Mahakki thawaibu nungsiba aduna madu mangjagani adubu taibangpan asida leiringeida mahakki thawaibu tukkachaba mahak aduna lomba naidana hingba phaoba madu thamgani <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Kanagumbana eibu thougal tourabadi mahak eigi itung in-gadabani; eina leiba maphamda eigi i-naisingsu leigani. Eibu thougal touba mahak adu eigi Ipana ikai khumnabigani.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna mahakki sibagi maramda haiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>“Houjik ei thawai ware, eibu kari haisige? ‘Ipa, eibu pungpham asidagi kanbiyu?’ Natte, masigi maramgidamak eina pungpham asida lakpani. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Ipa, nahakki minglen matik mangal chaohallu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Adudagi khonjel amana swargadagi hairak-i, “Eina eigi ming matik mangal chaohankhre aduga amuk henna chaohan-gani.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Mapham aduda lepliba miyamsing aduna khonjel adu tarammi aduga mi kharana hai, masi nong khongbani, adubu ateising kharana hai, swarga dut amana mangonda wa ngangbani.<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Khonjel adu eigi kananaba hairakpa natte adubu nakhoigi kananabani. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Houjik taibangpan asibu wayenba matamni; aduga taibangpan asigi mapu adu tanthokkhragani. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Eibu malem asidagi thanggatpa matamda eina mi pumnamakpu eigi i-nakta chingsin-gani.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Ibungona masi haibasi mahak karamba maongda sigani haiba adu khang-hanbani.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:4">Isei 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">Eze 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan 7:14</ref></char>
    </note>Miyamsing aduna khumlak-i, “Wayel Yathangdagi eikhoina khangle adudi Christtadi matam pumnamakta hingduna leigani. Aduga ‘Migi Machanupa adu thanggatpa tai’ haina nahakna kamdouna hairibano? Migi Machanupa hairibasi kanano?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Nakhoigi narakta mangal adu atenba matam kharaga leithakhigani. Nakhoina amamba nangdanaba mangal leiringeida chatlu. Amambada chatpa mi aduna mahak kadaida chatlibano haiba khangde. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Nakhoi mangalgi machasing oinanaba, mangal adu leiringeida nakhoina mangal adubu thajou.”</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 12:36">Misinggi thajagandaba</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Jisuna waphamsing asi hairamlaga chatkhre aduga masamak makhoidagi lotkhre. <verse eid="JHN 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Makhoigi mamangda Ibungona angakpa khudam pumnamaksing asi tourabasu makhoina Ibungobu thajaramde. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa 53:1</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Masi Mapu Ibungogi wa phongdokpa maichou Isaiah-na haikhiba wa adu thungnanabani:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Mapu Ibungo, eikhoina haijaba paodam kanana thajabibage?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Kanada MAPU IBUNGO-gi panggal phongdokpibage?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Makhoina thajaba ngamdabagi maramdi Isaiah-na mapham amada asumnasu haikhi,<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa 6:10</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>“Ibungona makhoigi mamit tang-halle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">aduga makhoigi thamoibu kalhalle,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">madu oirabadi makhoigi mitna uraroi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">aduga makhoigi thamoina wakhal taroi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">aduga eina makhoibu phahanbinaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">makhoina eingonda hallaklaroi”<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Isaiah-na masi haikhibasi mahakna Jisugi matik mangal ubadagi Ibungo mahakki maramda haibani.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Adum oinamak Jihudi luchingba mayam amana Jisubu thajarammi. Adubu Pharisee-singna makhoibu synagogue-tagi tanthokkani haibagi kiba maramna makhoina makhoigi thajaba adu phongdoklamde. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Masi misingna makhoibu thagatpa aduna Tengban Mapuna makhoibu thagatpiba adudagi henna makhoina pambagi maramnani.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisudi taibangpanbabu kanbinaba lakpani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Jisuna ahouba khonjelna hairak-i, “Mi amana eibu thajaba matamda mahakna eitabu thajaba natte adubu eibu thabirakpa Ibungo mahakpusu thajare. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Eibu uba mahak aduna eibu thabirakpa Ibungo mahakpusu ujare. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Eibu thajaba misingna amambada leitanaba ei taibangpanda mangal oina lakpani. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Kanagumbana eigi wahei taraga indrabadi eina mahakpu wayelloi. Maramdi eihak taibangpan asibu wayelnaba lakpa natte adubu taibangpan asibu kanbinaba lakpani. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Eibu yadaba amadi eigi waheibu loudaba makhoibu wayenba ama lei. Eina ngangthokkhraba waheising aduna makhoibu aroiba numitta wayen-gani. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Ei isa inthantadagi eina ngangba natte adubu eina kari haigadaba amadi ngangadaba haibadu eibu thabirakpa Ipana eingonda yathang pibi. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Ibungo mahakki yathangdi lomba naidana hingba aduda chingbi haiba eina khang-i. Maram aduna eina haiba khudingmak adu Ipana eingonda hainanaba haibibasingni.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna mahakki tung-inbasinggi makhongbu isingna hamdokpiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Masi Lanthokpibagi Chakkhangba numitki nongma mamangdani. Taibangpan asi thadoktuna Mapa Ibungogi manakta chatkadaba matam adu lakle haiba Jisuna khangle. Taibangpanda leiriba Ibungo masagi oiba misingbu Ibungona matam pumbada nungsi aduga Ibungona makhoibu aroiba phaoba nungsibire.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Numidanggi chaklen charingeida, Devil-na Simon-gi machanupa Judas Iscariot-ki thamoida Jisubu pithoknaba insinkhre. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Mapa Ibungo Tengban Mapuna pumnamakki mathakta pannaba matik Ibungoda pibire amadi mahak Tengban Mapudagi lakpani aduga Tengban Mapugi maphamda amuk han-gadouri haiba khanglammi. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Maram aduna Ibungona numidanggi chaklen charambadagi hougatlaga Ibungogi mapan thangba achonba phi adu louthoklaga khudei amana khwangda yetsille. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Madugi matungda Ibungona khudeng amada ising heiraga mahakki tung-inbasinggi makhong isingna hamdokpire aduga Ibungogi khwangda yetliba khudei aduna teithokpiba houre. <verse eid="JHN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Asumna Ibungona Simon Peter-gi manakta lakpada Peter-na Ibungoda hairak-i, “Ibungo, Ibungona eigi khong hambigadouribra?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Eina touriba asi houjik nahakna khangde adubu tungda nahakna khanglakkani.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Peter-na hairak-i, “Ibungo, Ibungona keidoungeidasu eigi khong hambiroidabani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Eina nahakki khong hambidrabadi nahak eihakka karisu mari leinade.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Adudagi Simon Peter-na hairak-i, “Adu oirabadi Ibungo, eigi khongda natte eigi khut amadi kokpusu chambiyu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Irujaraba mi amana mahakki khong nattana atei chamningai leite makhoigi hakchang pumba senglabani. Aduga mi amakhak nattana nakhoi pumnamak seng-i.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Jisuna mahakpu kanana pithokkani haiba hannana khangbagi maramna “Mi amakhak nattana nakhoi pumnamak sengle” haina haibani.<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:12-15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:27">Luk 22:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jisuna makhoigi khong hambiraba matungda mahakki mapan thangba achonba phi adu amuk setchille aduga hannagi phamphamda amuk phamthare aduga Ibungona makhoida hanglak-i, “Eina nakhoida toukhiba adu nakhoina khangba ngambra?” <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>“Nakhoina eibu Mapu Ibungo amadi Oja haina kou-i, madu achumbani maramdi nakhoina kouriba adumak eihak oiribani. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Nakhoigi Mapu amadi Oja oiriba eihakna nakhoigi khongsing hambire, nakhoinasu nakhoi amana amagi khong hambipham thok-i. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Eina nakhoida toukhibagumna nakhoinasu tounaba eina nakhoida thabak oina utle. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Jn 15:20</ref></char></note>Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini manaina mapudagi henna chaode aduga pao puriba mi amana mahakpu thariba mi adudagi henna chaode. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Houjikti nakhoina masising asi khangle aduna hairibasing asi nakhoina tourabadi nakhoi yaiphagani.<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Isei 41:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Eina masising asi nakhoi pumnamakki maramda haibadi natte; eina khanggatlaba makhoi adu eina khang-i. Adubu ‘Eigi tal chaba mahak aduna eigi maiyokta leple’ haiba Mapugi puyagi wa adu thungnanabani. <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Thoudok adu thokpa matamda, eihak asi eina hairiba mahak aduni haiba nakhoina thajanaba thoudok adu thoktringeida eina nakhoida hanna haibani. <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mrk 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref></char></note>Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, kanagumbana eina thaba mi amabu lousillabadi mahakna eibu lousillabani aduga eibu lousinba mahak aduna eibu thabirakpa Ibungo mahakpu lousillabani.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu pithokkadaba adu mangjounana phongdokpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mrk 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Jisuna masi hairaba tungda mahak thawai waraduna phongna hairak-i, “Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, nakhoigi naraktagi amana eibu pithokkani.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Ibungona haikhibadu kanagi maramda haibano haiba chamamnaduna Ibungogi tung-inbasingna makhoi masel amaga amaga yengnarammi. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Tung-inbasing adugi maraktagi Jisuna nungsijaba tung-inba aduna Jisugi manakta phamlammi. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Simon Peter-na mangonda inggit piduna hairak-i, “Ibungona hairibadu kanagi maramdano hang-u.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Maram aduna tung-inba aduna Ibungogi manakta naksallaga hanglak-i, “Ibungo, mahaktu kanano?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Eina tal machet ama tenggotta luplaga pigadouriba mahak aduni.” Adudagi Ibungona tal machet ama loure aduga tenggotta luplaga Simon Iscariot-ki machanupa Judas-ta pirammi. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Judas-na tal adu hek loubaga Satan-na mahakki nungda changkhre. Maduda Jisuna hairak-i, “Nahakna tougadaba adu thuna touro.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Chaklen aduda yaoriba kana amatana Jisuna hairiba adu karino haiba khanglamde. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Judas-na sen-gao panaba oibanina Jisuna mangonda Chakkhangba adugi changgadaba potlamsing leirunaba nattraga lairabasingda karigumba khara pirunaba haibani haina makhoina khallammi.<verse eid="JHN 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Judas-na tal adu hek loubaga khudakta thokkhre. Matam adu numidang oirammi.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anouba yathang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Judas-na thokkhrabada Jisuna hairak-i, “Houjik Migi Machanupa adubu matik mangal chaohalle aduga mahakki mapanna Tengban Mapubu matik mangal chaohalle. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Mahakki mapanna Tengban Mapubu matik mangal chaohallabadi Migi Machanupa adubu Tengban Mapu mahakki mapanna matik mangal chaohan-gani aduga thunamak mahakpu matik mangal chaohan-gani. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Jn 7:34</ref></char></note>Nungsiba angangsa, matam kharadang eina nakhoiga loinakhigani. Eina Jihudisingda haibagumna houjik eina nakhoida hairi, ‘Nakhoina eibu thigani adubu eina chatpa mapham aduda nakhoina lakpa ngamloi.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Jn 15:12</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Jn 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2 Jn 5</ref></char></note>Eina nakhoida anouba yathang ama piri madudi nakhoi amaga amaga nungsinou. Eina nakhoibu nungsibagumna nakhoinasu amaga amaga nungsinou. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Nakhoi amaga amaga nungsinarabadi mi khudingna nakhoi eigi tung-inbasingni haiba khanggani.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peter-na yaroidaba adu Jisuna mangjounana haiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mrk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simon Peter-na Ibungoda hanglak-i, “Ibungo, kadaida chatpigadouribano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Eina chatpa mapham aduda nakhoi houjik tung illakpa ngamloi adubu nakhoina konna itung in-gani.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Peter-na hanglak-i, “Ibungo, karigi houjik eina Ibungogi tung inba ngamloidouribano? Ei Ibungogidamak thawai thajagani.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Jisuna khumlak-i, “Tasengnamak nahak eigidamak thawai thagadra? Eina nangonda tasengnamak hairibasini yenbarabana khongdringeida nahakna eibu khangde haina ahumlak haigani .”<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Lambi adu Jisuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Jisuna mahakki tung-inbasingda hairak-i, “Nakhoi pukning langtaknaganu. Tengban Mapubu thajou aduga eibusu thajou. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Eigi Ipagi yumda leipham yamna lei madu natlamdrabadi eina nakhoida hairamgadabani. Eina nakhoigidamak mapham thourang touba chatli. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Aduga eina chattuna nakhoigidamak mapham thourang touraba matungda, eina leiba mapham aduda nakhoisu eiga leiminnanaba eina nakhoibu louba lakkani. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Eina chatkadaba mapham adugi lambi adu nakhoina khang-i.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Maduda Thomas-na hairak-i, “Ibungo, Ibungona kadaida lenglibano haiba eikhoi khangjade aduna kamdouna eikhoina lambi adu khanggadouribano?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Jisuna khumlak-i, “Lambi adusu achumba adusu hingba adusu eini. Eigi ipanna nattana kana amatana eigi Ipagi maphamda thungba ngamloi. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Nakhoina eibu tasengna khanglamlabadi eigi Ipabusu khanglamgadabani. Houjiktagidi nakhoina Ibungo mahakpu khangle amasung ure.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Maduda Philip-na hairak-i, “Ibungo, Ibungogi Ipa adu eikhoida uhanbiyu, maduna eikhoigi apenba oijagani.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Jisuna khumlak-i, “Philip, asuk kuina eina nahakka loinaraba phaoba nahakna houjik phaoba eibu khangdribra? Eibu uba mahak aduna Ipa adubu ure. Aduna karamna nahakna ‘Ipa adu eikhoida uhanabiyu’ haina hairibano? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Eina Ipada lei aduga Ipana eingonda lei haibasi nahak thajadabra? Eina nakhoida haiba waheising asi eigi isadagi natte. Adubu eingonda leiriba Ipa aduna thabak touribani. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Eina Ipada lei aduga Ipana eingonda lei haiba asida eibu thajou. Nattraga eina touba thabaksing adugi maramna eibu thajou. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, eibu thajaba misingna eina touba thabaksing tougani. Makhoina masising asidagi henna chaoba thabaksing tougani maramdi eina Ipagi maphamda chatli. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Machanupa adugi mapanna Mapa adubu matik mangal phang-hannaba nakhoina eigi mingda nija nijaba khudingmak eina toubigani. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Nakhoina eingonda karigumba ama eigi mingda nijarabadi nijariba adu eina toubigani.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thawai asengba thabirakkani wasakpiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>“Nakhoina eibu nungsirabadi, nakhoina eigi yathangsing ngakkani. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Eina Ipada haijagani aduga Ipana nakhoida atoppa Pangbiba ama thabirakkani aduga mahakna nakhoiga matam pumbada loinabigani. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Ibungo mahakti Mapu Ibungogi oiba achumba adubu phongdokpiba Thawai aduni. Taibangpanna Ibungo mahakpu lousinba ngamde maramdi makhoina Ibungo mahakpu usu ude khangsu khangde.<verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>“Eina nakhoibu pidat padatpa machasinggum thanamloi; eina nakhoigi nanakta amuk lakkani. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Matam khara leiraga taibangpanbana eibu amuk uraroi adubu nakhoinadi eibu ugani. Eina hingbagi maramna nakhoisu hinggani. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Eina Ipada lei, nakhoina eingonda lei aduga eina nakhoida lei haibasi numit aduda nakhoina khanggani.<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>“Eigi yathangsingbu louba amadi yathangsing adubu inba makhoi adu eibu nungsibani. Eibu nungsiba makhoi adubu eigi Ipana nungsigani aduga einasu nungsigani amadi eisamak makhoida phongdokpigani.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Adudagi Judas-na (Judas Iscariot nattaba) hairak-i, “Ibungo, Ibungona nasabu eikhoida phongdokpigani aduga taibangpanbadadi phongdokpiroi hairibasigi maram karino?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Kanagumbana eibu nungsirabadi, mahakna eigi wa in-gani. Eigi Ipana mahakpu nungsigani aduga eikhoina mangonda laktuna mahakka loinana leiminnagani. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Eibu nungsidaba mahak aduna eigi wasing ngakloi. Nakhoina tariba waheising asi ei isagi natte waheising asi eibu thabirakliba Ipa mahakkini.<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>“Eina nakhoiga leiminnaringeida masising asi eina haibani. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Eigi mingda Ipana nakhoida thabirakkadaba Pangbiba haibadi Thawai Asengba Ibungo mahakna pumnamak nakhoida tambigani aduga eina nakhoida haikhiba pumnamak nakhoida ningsing-hanbirakkani.<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>“Eina nakhoida ingthaba thanammi; eigi ingthaba eina nakhoida pi. Taibangpanna pibagumna eina madu nakhoida piba natte. Maram asina nakhoi kiganu amadi pukning langtaknaganu. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>‘Ei chatlagani aduga nakhoigi nanakta amuk lakkani’ haina eina haiba asi nakhoina tare. Nakhoina eibu nungsirabadi, eina Ipagi maphamda chatkadaba maramna nakhoi haraogani maramdi Ipana eingondagi henna chao-i. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Thoudok asi thokpa matamda nakhoina thajananaba thoktringeida eina masi nakhoida haibani. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Eina nakhoiga yamna ngangnararoi maramdi taibangpan asigi mapu mahak lakli. Eigi ithakta mahakki panggal leite. <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>Eina Ipabu nungsi haiba taibangpanbana khangnanaba Ipana eingonda pibiba yathang adumak eina tou-i.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Hougatlo, eikhoi mapham asidagi chatlasi.<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Anggur mari amadi masasing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>“Achumba anggur mari adu eini aduga eigi Ipana ingkhol koiba mi aduni. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Mahei yandaba masasing adu Ibungo mahakna kakthatli aduga mahei yanba masasing adubu mahei henna yananaba masa mareng kakthatpi. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Eina nakhoida haikhiba wa adugi maramna nakhoi sengle. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Eingonda tattana leiyu aduga eina nakhoida tattana leigani. Masa amatana masa mathanta mahei yanba ngamde aduna masa adu anggur pambi aduda leiba tai. Adugumduna nakhoina eingonda tattana leiba nattana mahei yanba ngamloi.<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>“Anggur mari adu eini aduga nakhoina masasingni. Nakhoina eingonda itattattana leirabadi eina nakhoida lei aduga nakhoina mahei yan-gani; ei yaodana nakhoi karisu touba ngamloi. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Nakhoina eingonda tattana leitrabadi nakhoi hundoklaba amadi kangsillaba masa amagumle. Adugumba masasing adudi loukhattuna meinungda langsilli aduga mei thadok-i. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Nakhoina eingonda tattana leirabadi eigi waheising nakhoida tattana lei, adu oirabadi nakhoina niningba adu nijou madu nakhoida pibigani. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Nakhoina mahei yamna yanduna eigi tung-inbasingni haina utpa aduda eigi Ipagi matik mangal oihalli. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Eigi Ipana eibu nungsibagumna eina nakhoibu nungsi. Eigi nungsibada tattana leiyu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Eina Ipagi yathang ngaktuna Ibungo mahakki nungsibada leibagumna, nakhoina eigi yathang ngaklabadi nakhoina eigi nungsibada leigani.<verse eid="JHN 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>“Eigi haraoba nakhoida leiduna nakhoigi haraoba mapung phananaba eina masi nakhoida haibani. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Jn 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:17">15:17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Jn 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2 Jn 5</ref></char></note>Eina nakhoibu nungsibagum nakhoinasu amaga amaga nungsinou: masi eigi yathangni. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Mi amana mahakki marupsinggidamak leiba khwaidagi athoiba nungsiba adudi makhoigidamak mahakki thawai thadokpa aduni. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Eina nakhoida piba yathangsing asi nakhoina tourabadi nakhoi eigi marupni. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Eina nakhoibu amuk hanna minai kouraroi maramdi minaina mahakki mapuna kari touribano haibadu khangde. Adubu eina nakhoibu marup koure maramdi eina Ipadagi taba pumnamak adu nakhoida khang-halle. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Nakhoina eibu khanba natte adubu nakhoina chattuna tattana leiba mahei yannanaba nakhoibu eina khalle amadi pham haple. Eigi mingda Ipagi maphamda nakhoina niningba adu nijabada Ipana nakhoida pibigani. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Eina nakhoida piba yathang adudi masini: Nakhoi amaga amaga nungsinou.<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Taibangpanbana tung-inbasingbu tukkachaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>“Taibangpanbana nakhoibu tukkacharabadi nakhoibu tukkachadringeida eibu hanna tukkachei haibasi nakhoina ningsing-u. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Nakhoi taibangpanbagi mi oiramlabadi, taibangpanbana nakhoibu masagi oibagum nungsiramgadabani. Nakhoina taibangpanbagi mi oirambadagi eina nakhoibu khandoklabanina nakhoi taibangpanbagi oidre. Maram aduna taibangpanbana nakhoibu tukkachabani. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jn 13:16</ref></char></note>‘Minaina mahakki mapudagi henna chaode’ haina eina nakhoida haikhiba adu ningsing-u. Makhoina eibu ot-neirabadi nakhoibusu ot-neigani, makhoina eigi tambiba adu illabadi nakhoigi tambibasu in-gani. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Nakhoi eigi oiba maramna makhoina nakhoida pumnamak asi tougani maramdi makhoina eibu thabirakpa Ibungo mahakpu khangde. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Eina laktuna makhoida wa nganglamdrabadi makhoi papki maral leiramloidabani. Adubu houjikti makhoi pap kupsinpham leite. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Kanagumba amana eibu tukkacharabadi mahakna eigi Ipabusu tukkachare. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Eina makhoigi marakta mi kana amatana toukhidriba thabaksing touramdrabadi makhoi papki maral leiramloidabani. Adubu houjikti makhoina angakpa thabaksing ure aduga makhoina eibusu eigi Ipabusu tukkachare. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Isei 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69:4</ref></char></note>‘Makhoina maram leitana eibu tukkachei’ haina Wayel Yathangda ikhiba adu thungnanabani.<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>“Ipana nakhoida thabirakkadaba achumbagi Thawai oiriba Ipadagi lakkadaba Pangbiba Ibungo mahakna eigi maramda haigani. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Houbadagi nakhoina eiga loinarakpa maramna nakhoinasu eigi maramda wa nganggadabani.<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>“Nakhoigi thajaba mangdananaba eina nakhoida pumnamak asi hairibani. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Makhoina nakhoibu Synagogue-singdagi tanthokkani aduga nakhoibu hatpa misingna Tengban Mapuda thougal toubani haina khan-gadaba matam adu lakli. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Makhoina Ipabusu eibusu khangdabagi maramna makhoina hairibasing asi nakhoida tougani. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Matam adu lakpada eina nakhoida hannana cheksin wa haikhre haiba nakhoina ningsingnanaba eina waphamsing asi nakhoida hairibani.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Thawai Asengbagi thabak</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Eina nakhoiga loinaduna leiba maramna ahanbadadi eina masi nakhoida haidabani. <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Houjikti eihak eibu thabirakpa Ibungo mahakki maphamda chatlagani adubu nakhoi kana amatana ‘Nahak kadaida chatkadouribano’ haina eingonda hangde. <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Adubu eina waphamsing asi haibagi maramna nakhoigi pukning awabana thalle. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Adubu eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, eina chatthokpa asi nakhoigidamak aphabani. Karigumba eina chatthoktrabadi Pangbiba Ibungo mahak adu nakhoigi naphamda lakloi. Aduga eina chatthoklabadi Ibungo mahakna nakhoigi naphamda lakkani. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Ibungo mahakna lakpa matamda papki oiba maram, achumba chatpagi maram amasung wayen-gi matangda taibangpanbabu lalli haiba utkani. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Papki matangdadi misingna eibu thajadabagi maramdani; <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>achumba chatpagi matangdadi ei Ipagi maphamda chatli aduga nakhoina eibu amuk uraroi; <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>aduga wayen-gi matangdadi taibangpan-gi mapu adu wayenkhre.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>“Eina nakhoida haigadaba yamna leiri adubu houjik nakhoina madu puba ngamloi. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Achumbagi Thawai aduna lakpa matamda Ibungo mahakna nakhoibu achumba pumnamakta chingbigani. Ibungo mahakna mahakki masagi oibadagi ngangloi adubu mahakna taba adu khakta nganggani aduga Ibungo mahakna tungda thoklagadabasing adu nakhoida haibigani. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Ibungo mahakna eina haiba adu louraga nakhoida haibiduna eingonda matik mangal oihan-gani. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Ipagi areiba pumnamak eigini; maram aduna eigi oiba adudagi louraga Thawai aduna nakhoida haibigani haina eina hairibani.<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Awabadu haraoba oirakpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>“Matam khara leiraga nakhoina eibu uraroi aduga matam khara leiraga nakhoina eibu amuk ugani.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Ibungogi tung-inba kharana makhoi masel amaga amaga ngangnarak-i, “Ibungona hairibasi kari hairibano? ‘Matam khara leiraga nakhoina eibu uraroi aduga matam khara leiraga nakhoina eibu amuk ugani,’ aduga mahakna asisu hai ‘Maramdi ei Ipagi maphamda chatkadouri.’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>‘Matam khara leiraga’ hairibasi Ibungona kari haininglibano? Ibungona hairibasi karino haiba eikhoi khangba ngamde.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Makhoina hiram asigi matangda hangningle haiba Jisuna khangladuna makhoida hairak-i, “Eina nakhoida ‘Matam khara leiraga nakhoina eibu uraroi aduga matam khara leiraga nakhoina eibu amuk ugani’ haina nakhoida haiba adugi wahanthok karino haina nakhoi nasen hangnaribra? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, taibangpanbana haraoringeida nakhoina kapkani. Nakhoi wagani adubu nakhoigi awaba adu haraobada onthokkani. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Nupi amana angang unaramdaida naoyek-i maramdi mahakki pungpham adu lakle. Adubu mahakna angang adu hek pokpada, angang ama taibangpanbada pokle haibagi haraobana mahakki awaba adu kaothok-i. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Adugumduna houjik nakhoigi awaba matamni adubu eina nakhoiga amuk unagani maduda nakhoi haraogani aduga kana amatana nakhoidagi haraobadu louthokpa ngamloi.<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>“Numit adu lakpada nakhoina eingonda karisu hangloi. Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, nakhoina eigi mingda Ipagi maphamda nijaba adu Ipana nakhoida pibigani. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Houjik phaoba nakhoina eigi mingda karisu nijadri; nakhoigi haraoba mapung phanaba nijou aduga nakhoina phangjagani.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Taibangpanbabu ngamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>“Eina nakhoida pandamsing sijinnaduna haibani adubu pandamsing sijinnadana Ipagi maramda phongna eina nakhoida haigadaba matam adu lakli. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Numit aduda nakhoina eigi mingda Ipada nijagani. Eina nakhoigidamak Ipada haijagani haiba natte, <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>maramdi Ipa Ibungo mahakmakna nakhoibu nungsi. Nakhoina eibu nungsiba amadi eihak Ipagi maphamdagi lakpani haina nakhoina thajabagi maramna Ipana nakhoibu nungsi. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Eina Ipagi maphamdagi thoraklaga taibangpan asida lakpani aduga houjikti eihak taibangpan asi thadoktuna Ipagi maphamda hallagani.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Maduda Ibungogi tung-inbasingna Ibungoda hairak-i, “Houjikti Ibungona pandam sijinnadana sengna haibire. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Ibungona pumnamak khang-i haiba houjikti eikhoina khangle aduga kanagumba amana Ibungoda wahang hangbagi kanaba leitre. Masina Ibungodi Tengban Mapudagi lakpani haibasi eikhoida thajahalli.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i, “Houjikti nakhoina thajarabra? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Nakhoi pumnamakna nasa nasagi maphamda ichai chaithokkhiduna eihak ithanta thadoklamgadaba pungpham adu lakkadouri, hoi, madu houjik lakle. Adubu ei ithanta oide maramdi Ipana eiga loinabiri. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Nakhoina eingonda leiraga ingthaba phangnanaba eina nakhoida masi haibani. Taibangpan asida nakhoida awaba nungaitaba leigani adubu nathouna phou maramdi eina taibangpanbabu ngamle!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna mahakki tung-inbasinggidamak haijaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Jisuna masi hairaba matungda Ibungona swargada yengkhatlaga hairak-i, “Ipa matam adu lakle. Ibungogi Nachanupana Ibungobu natik nangal chaohannaba Nachanupabu matik mangal chaohanbiyu. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Ibungona mangonda mi pumnamakki mathakta matik pibire madu Ibungona mangonda pibiba makhoi pumnamakta mahakna lomba naidaba hingba pinanabani. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Amatta ngairaba achumba Tengban Mapu nahakpu khangba amadi Ibungona thabirakpa Jisu Christtabu khangba asi lomba naidana hingba aduni. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Eina pangthoknanaba Ibungona eingonda pibiba thabak adu pangthokpa loiraduna taibangpan asida eihakna Ibungogi matik mangal chaohalle. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Ipa, taibangpan asi semdringeida eina Ibungoga loinana leiramba matik mangal adumak houjik eibu Ibungogi manakta matik mangal chaohanbiyu.<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>“Taibangpan asidagi Ibungona eingonda pibiba makhoida eina Ibungo nahakpu phongdokle. Makhoi Ibungogini, Ibungona eingonda pibibani. Makhoina Ibungogi wa injare. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Eigi leijaba pumnamak Ibungo nahakna pibibani haiba makhoina houjikti khangle. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Ibungona eingonda pibiba wasing adu eina makhoida pire aduga makhoina wasing adu lousille. Eihak Ibungodagi lakpani haiba makhoina tasengna khangle aduga Ibungona eibu thabirakpani haiba makhoina thajare.<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>“Eina makhoigidamak haijabani. Eina taibangpan-gidamak haijaba natte adubu Ibungona eingonda pibikhiba makhoising adugidamak haijabani maramdi makhoi Ibungogini. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Eigi leijaba pumnamak Ibungogini aduga Ibungogi areiba pumnamak eigini. Aduga makhoigi mapanna eingonda matik mangal lakle. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Aduga houjik eihak Ibungogi maphamda laklani. Eidi taibangpanda leiraroi adubu makhoidi taibangpanda leiri. Asengba Ipa, eikhoina amata oibagumna makhoisu amata oinanaba Ibungona eingonda pibiba Ibungogi ming adugi panggalna makhoibu ngak senbiyu. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Eina makhoiga loinaringeida Ibungona eingonda pibiba ming aduna eina makhoibu ngak sellammi. Mapu Ibungogi puyada ikhiba adu thungnanaba amangbagi machanupa adu nattana kana mata mangde. <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Houjikti ei Ibungogi maphamda laklani. Eigi haraoba asi makhoida mapung phana leinanaba waphamsing asi eina taibangpanda leiringei haibani. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Eina Ibungo nahakki wa makhoida pire aduga taibangpanbana makhoibu tukkachare maramdi eina taibangpanbagi oidabagumna makhoisu taibangpanbagi natte. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Makhoibu taibangpan asidagi louthokpiyu haina eina Ibungoda haijaba natte adubu Phattaba Mahak adudagi makhoibu ngak senbiyu haijabani. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Eina taibangpanbagi oidabagum makhoisu taibangpanbagi natte. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Achumba aduna makhoibu sengdokpiyu; Ibungogi wadi achumbani. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Ibungona eibu taibangpanda thabibagumna einasu makhoibu taibangpanda thare. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Ibungogi achumba aduna makhoibu sengdoknaba makhoigidamak eina isamak sengdokchei.<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>“Eina makhoi khaktagi haijaba natte adubu makhoigi wadagi thajarakkadaba makhoisinggisu haijari. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Makhoi pumnamak amata oinanaba eina haijari. Ipa, Ibungona eingonda aduga eina Ibungoda leibagum makhoinasu eikhoida leinanaba haijabani aduga masina Ibungona eibu thabirakpani haiba taibangpanbana thajanabani. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Eikhoina amata oibagum makhoisu amata oinanaba, Ibungona eingonda pibiba matik mangal adu eina makhoida pire. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Eina makhoida lei aduga Ibungona eingonda lei. Ibungona eibu thabirakpani aduga Ibungona eibu nungsibagum Ibungona makhoibu nungsi haibasi taibangpanbana khangnanaba makhoibu mapung phana amata oihanbiyu.<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>“Ipa, taibangpan asi semdringeigi mamangda Ibungona eibu nungsibagi maramna Ibungona eingonda pibikhiba matik mangal adu makhoina ujanaba, Ibungona eingonda pibiba makhoi pumnamak eina leiba maphamda eiga leiminnaba pamjei. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>Achumba chatpa Ipa, taibangpanbana nahakpu khangdrabasu einadi Ibungo nahakpu khang-i aduga Ibungona eibu thabirakpani haibasi eigi tung-inbasing makhoina khang-i. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Ibungona eibu nungsiba manungsi adu makhoida leinanaba aduga eina makhoida leinanaba, Ibungobu makhoida khang-halle aduga makhoida makha tana khang-hankhigani.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu phaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mrk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Jisuna haijaba loirabada Ibungona mahakki tung-inbasingga loinana Kidron lok lanthokle. Mapham aduda ingkhol ama leirammi maduda Jisu amadi mahakki tung-inbasingna chatlammi. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Jisuna mahakki tung-inbasingga toina unaba mapham oibanina mapham asi Jisubu pithokpa Judas-na khanglammi. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Maram asina Judas-na Rome-gi lanmising amadi Ningnasanggi lanmi kangbu ama puduna athoiba purohitsing amasung pharisee-singga loinana ingkhol aduda laklammi. Makhoina meira, thaomei amadi khutlai pairaklammi. <verse eid="JHN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Ibungona mangonda thoklagadaba pumnamak adu khangladuna Ibungona thoraktuna makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoina kanabu thiribano?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>“Eikhoi Nazareth-ki Jisubu thiribani,” haina makhoina khumlak-i.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Maduda Jisuna hairak-i, “Mahak adu eini.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Jisubu pithokpa Judas mapham aduda makhoiga loinana leptuna leirammi. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>“Mahak adu eini” haina Jisuna haiba matamda makhoina tung hallaga leimaida ture. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Ibungona makhoida amuk hanglak-i, “Nakhoina kanabu thiribano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Maduda makhoina khumlak-i, “Eikhoi Nazareth-ki Jisubu thiribani,”<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>“Mahak adu eini haina eina nakhoida haikhre,” haina Jisuna khumlak-i. “Nakhoina eibu thiba oirabadi makhoising adu chat-hankhro” <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>(“Ipa, nahakna eingonda pibiba makhoi kana amatabu eina mang-hande,” haiba Ibungogi wahei adu thungnaba Ibungona masi haibani.)<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Maduda Simon Peter-na mahakki thangsang adu satlaga purohitlen-gi manaigi yet thangba mana adu kakthatlammi. Manai adugi maming Malchus kou-i. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mat 26:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mrk 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:42">Luk 22:42</ref></char></note>Jisuna Peter-da hairak-i, “Thangsang adu makhumda hapchillu. Ipana eingonda piba awabagi tenggot adu eina thakloidra?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Annas-ki mangda Jisubu purakpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Rome-gi lanmi kangbu amadi makhoigi luchingbasing aduga ningnasanggi lanmisinggana Jisubu pharammi amadi pullammi <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>aduga makhoina Jisubu Annas-ki manakta hanna puraklammi. Annas chahi adugi Purohitlen oiriba Caiaphas-ki makubokni. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:49">Jn 11:49</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 11:50">50</ref></char></note>Mi amana miyamgi mahutta sibana henna phei haina Jihudisinggi luchingbasingda paotak pikhiba mi adu Caiaphas asini.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peter-na Jisubu yadaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69">Mat 26:69</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:70">70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mrk 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simon Peter amadi atoppa tung-inba aduna Jisugi tung illammi. Atoppa tung-inba aduga purohitlen aduga munna khangnaba maramna mahakna Jisuga loinana purohitlen-gi sumangda changlammi. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Adubu Peter-di mapanda thong manakta leplammi. Purohitlenna masak khangba atoppa tung-inba aduna hallaktuna mapham aduda thong sangbagi mathou touribi nupimacha aduda hairaga Peter-bu manungda pusillammi. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Thongsangbi nupimacha aduna Peter-da hairak-i, “Nahaksu mi asigi tung-inabasinggi marakta ama nattra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Maduda Peter-na khumlak-i, “Ei natte.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Matam adu ingbagi maramna minaising amadi ngaksellibasing aduna meitan thagatlaga madugi akoibada leptuna mei tiklammi. Peter-su makhoiga loinana leptuna mei tikminnarammi.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Purohitlenna Jisubu wahang paohangba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mrk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Purohitlenna Ibungogi tung-inbasing amadi Ibungogi tambibagi matangda Ibungoda hanglammi. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Eina taibangpanda iphong phongna wa hai aduga Jihudisingna tinnaba maphamsing haibadi synagogue-sing amadi Mapugi Sanglenda eina tambibani. Eina kari amata lonna haikhide. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Aduga karigi nahakna eingonda madugi wahang adu hanglibano? Eina haiba takhiba makhoi aduda eina kari kari haikhi haibadu hang-u. Eina haikhiba adu makhoina khangbani.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Jisuna masi haiba matamda lanmi amana Ibungogi maida khubakna tharaga hairak-i, “Nangna adumna Purohitlenda khumbra?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Maduda Jisuna hairak-i, “Eina aranba haikhiba leiradi madu leiriba mayam mamang asida haiyu. Aduga eina achumba hairabadi karigi nahakna eingonda nakhut tharibano?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Madudagi Annas-na pullaga leiriba Ibungobu Purohitlen Caiaphas-ki maphamda tharammi.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peter-na Jisubu yadaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-75">Mat 26:1-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mrk 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Mapham aduda Peter leptuna mei tiklammi. Maduda makhoina Peter-da hanglak-i, “Nahaksu mi asigi tung-inba ama nattra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Madu Peter-na yaramde aduga hairak-i, “Ei natte.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Peter-na mana kakkhiba nupa adugi mari mata oiba purohitlen-gi manai amana Peter-da hairak-i, “Ingkhol aduda nahakna mahakka loinana leiba adu eina ukhidabra?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Madu Peter-na amuk hanna yaramde. Khudak aduda yenbarabana khonglak-i.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilate-na Jisubu wayenba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mat 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mrk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Jihudisingna Jisubu Caiaphas-ki maphamdagi Rome-gi leingak mapugi sanggaida puraklammi. Matam adu ayuk anganba oirammi. Makhoina Lanthokpibagi chakkhangba adu yaoba yananaba laininggi oiba masa sengna leinanaba makhoina sanggai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Praetorium </char></note> manungdadi changlamde. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Maram aduna Pilate-na mapanda thoraktuna makhoida hanglak-i, “Nakhoina mi asi kari maral lei hairibano?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Maduda makhoina khumlak-i, “Mahak asi phattaba touba mi oiramdrabadi eikhoina mahakpu nahakki naphamda puraklamloi.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Pilate-na hairak-i, “Nakhoina mahakpu puduna nakhoigi wayel yathanggi matung inna wayellu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Maduda makhoina khumlak-i, “Mi amabu hatpa yabagi ayaba adu eikhoida pide.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Jn 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12:32</ref></char></note>Masi Jisuna mahak karamba ma-ongda sigani haina haikhiba adu thungnanabani.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Madudagi Pilate-na sanggai manungda amuk changle aduga Jisubu kousillaga hanglak-i, “Nahak Jihudisinggi ningthoura?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Jisuna khumlak-i, “Madu nahak nasadagi lakpa wahangla nattraga atoppa misingna nangonda eigi maramda haibagira?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilate-na khumlak-i, “Eibu Jihudira? Nahakki mising amadi athoiba purohitsingna nahakpu eingonda sinnarakpani. Nahakna kari toukhrabage?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Maduda Jisuna hairak-i, “Eigi leibakti taibangpan asigi natte. Taibangpan asigi oiramlabadi Jihudisingna eibu phaba thingnanaba eigi inaisingna lan soknaramgadabani. Adubu eigi leibakti mapham asigi natte.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Pilate-na hairak-i, “Adu oirabadi nahak ningthounine!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Ei ningthouni haina nahakna haiba adu nahakna chumna haire. Maram asigidamak eihak pokpani amadi achumbagi maramda hainanaba taibangpan asida lakpani. Achumbagi maikeida leiba mi khudingna eigi khonjel tai.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilate-na Ibungoda hanglak-i, “Achumba haibasi karino?”</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 18:38">Jisubu hatnanaba yathang piba</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mrk 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Madudagi Pilate-na mapanda thoktuna makhoida hairak-i, “Eina mangonda maral piba yaba kari amata phangde. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Adubu Lanthokpibagi chakkhangba matamda eina mi amabu thadokpagi nakhoigi chatnabi lei. Maram aduna Jihudisinggi ningthou adu nakhoigidamak thadokpa pambra?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Maduda makhoina kanna laorak-i, “Natte, mahak natte! Barabbas-pu thadok-u!” (Barabbas asi daku amani.)<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Adudagi Pilate-na yathang piduna Jisubu phuhallammi. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Lanmising aduna tingkhanggi luhup ama semlaga Ibungogi makokta upsinbire aduga makhoina manggra machugi phi ama insinbire. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Makhoina Ibungogi manakta changsillaga hairak-i, “Khurumjari, he Jihudisinggi Ningthou!” Adudagi makhoina Ibungogi mamaida khubakna tharammi.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilate-na amuk hanna mapanda thoraklaga makhoida hairak-i, “Yeng-u, Eina mangonda maral piba yaba kari amata phangde haiba nakhoina khangnanaba mahakpu nakhoigi namangda puthorakli.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Jisuna tingkhanggi luhuptu uplaga amadi manggra machugi phi adu induna thorakle aduga pilate-na makhoida hairak-i, “Yeng-u, mi adu asida leire!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Athoiba purohitsing amadi Mapugi Sanglen-gi ngaksenbasing aduna Ibungobu ubada kanna laorak-i, “Mahakpu cross-ta hatlu! Mahakpu cross-ta hatlu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Maduda Pilate-na makhoida khumlak-i, “Adu oirabadi nakhoina mahakpu cross-ta hatlu. Aduga eigi oinadi, mangonda maral piba yaba kari amata phangde.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Jihudisingna mangonda khumlak-i, “Eikhoigi wayel yathang lei aduga wayel yathang adugi matung inna mahak sipham thok-i maramdi mahakna masabu Tengban Mapugi Machanupani haina haijei.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Pilate-na wa asi tabada mahak amukka henna kirammi. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Mahakna sanggaida amuk changlaga Jisuda hanglak-i, “Nahak kadaidagi lakpano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Adubu Jisuna paokhum amata piramde. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Maduda Pilate-na Jisuda hairak-i, “Nahak eingonda wa amata nganglaroidra? Eina nahakpu cross-ta hatpa nattraga thadokpagi matik eingonda lei haibasi nahak khangdabra?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Mapu Ibungona nangonda pibiba nattrabadi nahakna eigi ithakta matik leiramloidabani. Maram asina eibu nangonda pithokpa mahak aduna maral henna chao-i.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Pilate-na masi tabada Ibungobu thadoknaba hotnarammi adubu Jihudi luchingbasing aduna laorak-i, “Nahakna mahakpu thadoklabadi, nahak Caesar-gi marup natte. Kanagumba amana masabu ningthouni haijarabadi mahak Caesar-gi yeknabani.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Pilate-na wasi tabada Jisubu mapanda puthokle aduga Nungna Chanba Mapham kouba (Hebrew londa Gabbatha haina kouba) adugi wayel phambeida mahakna phamle. <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Madu Lanthokpibagi Chakkhangbagi nongma watlingei aduga numit yungba aduwaidani. Pilate-na Jihudisingda hairak-i, “Nakhoigi ningthou mapham asida leire.”<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Makhoina kanna laorak-i, “Mahak puthokkhro! Mahak Puthokkhro! Mahakpu cross-ta hatlu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Maduda Pilate-na hanglak-i, “Eina nakhoigi ningthoubu cross-ta hatkadra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Athoiba purohitsingna khumlak-i, “Caesar nattana eikhoigi ningthou atei leite.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Adudagi Pilate-na Ibungobu cross-ta hatnanaba makhoida sinakhre.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Jisubu cross-ta hatpa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mrk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Maram aduna makhoina Jisubu pukhre. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Lukang haina khangnaba (Hebrew londa Golgotha haina kouba) mapham aduda Ibungona masagi cross adu puduna chatlammi. <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Mapham aduda makhoina Ibungobu cross-ta pang tingle aduga Ibungogi oi yettasu mi ani amagasu pang tinglammi. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Iraga khanghanba ama semsaraga Pilate-na cross mathakta thetle. Maduda iriba adudi asini, “Nazareth-ki Jisu, Jihudisinggi Ningthou.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Jisubu pang tingliba maphamdu sahar manak oibanina Jihudi mayam amana thetlaga khanghalliba a-iba adu parammi. Thetlaga khanghalliba adu Hebrew, Latin amadi Greek londa ibani. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Athoiba purohitsing aduna Pilate-ta hairak-i, “‘Jihudisinggi Ningthou’ haina iganu madugi mahutta ‘Masana masabu Jihudisinggi ningthouni haijaba mi’ haina ibiyu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Maduda Pilate-na khumlak-i, “Eina ikhraba adu ikhre.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Lanmising aduna Jisubu pang tinglaba matungda makhoina Ibungogi maphising loure aduga makhoina amamam phangnanaba phising adu saruk mari thok-halle. Makhoina Ibungogi achonba phi adubusu loure. Achonba phi adu langdai leitaba phi amatadagi sabani. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Isei 22:18</ref></char></note>Lanmising aduna makhoi masel hainarammi, “Phi asidi eikhoi segaigumsi. Masi kanagi oigadage haiba laibak chang yengnasi.” Thoudok asi Mapugi puyada ikhraba adu thungnanabani, madudi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Makhoina eigi phiron makhoigi marakta yennagani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">aduga eigi achonba phigidamak laibak chang yengnagani.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Masimak lanmising aduna tourammi.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Ibungogi cross adugi manakta Ibungogi mama, mamagi manaonupi, Clopas-ki nupi Mary amadi Mary Magdalene leptuna leirammi. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Jisuna mama amadi manakta lepliba mahakna nungsijaba tung-inba adu ubada mamada hairak-i, “Nungsirabi nupi, nahakki nachanupa asida leire.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Adudagi Ibungona tung-inba aduda hairak-i, “Mahak nahakki namani.” Matam adudagi houna tung-inba aduna Mary-bu mahakki yumda purammi.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu siba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mrk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:21">Isei 69:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:15">22:15</ref></char>
    </note>Houjikti thabak pumnamak loire haiba Jisuna khangladuna Mapugi puyada i-ba adu thungnanaba Ibungona hairak-i, “Ei khourangle.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Mapham aduda asinba yuna thanna yaoba chaisen ama leirammi maduda makhoina sponge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Achouba ipakta leiba thawai panba potsak amadagi oirakpa ising chupsinba potsak ama. </char></note> ama luplaga asinba yu adu chupsilhalle aduga hyssop macheida haplaga Jisugi chinbanda thamlammi. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Jisuna madu tanglabada Ibungona hairak-i, “Loire.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Madudagi Ibungona kok lekthaduna thawai thakhre.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisugi puknopta tana thinba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Numit adu maru oiba Potthaba numitki nongma watlingei semsaba numit oirammi. Maram aduna Potthaba numitta hakchangsing adu cross-ta yanduna leiba adu pamdabadagi Jihudisingna Pilate-ki maphamda laktuna cross-ta yalliba hakchangsing adu makhong thudeklaga cross-tagi puthanaba haijarammi. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Maram aduna lanmising aduna Jisuga loinana pang tingkhraba ahanba mi adugi makhong hanna thudekle aduga atoppa mi adugi makhong thudekle. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Adubu lanmising aduna Jisugi manakta lakpadadi Jisudi hannana siramle maram aduna makhoina Ibungogi khongdi thudektre. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Adubu lanmi amanadi Ibungogi puknopta tana thillammi aduga khudak adumaktada eega isingga thoklaklammi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>(Thoudok adumak uhouba mi amana haibani aduga mahakna haiba adu achumbani. Mahakna achumba haibani haiba mahak khang-i aduga nakhoinasu thajananaba mahakna haibani.) <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Khong 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Masing 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Isei 34:20</ref></char></note>Thoudok asi Mapugi puyada ikhiba “Ibungogi saru ama phaoba tekloi” haina ikhiba wa adu thungnanabani. <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zec 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Phong 1:7</ref></char></note>Aduga Mapugi puyagi mapham amada asumna hai, “Tana thinkhraba Ibungoda makhoina yenggani.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu leirol chanba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mrk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Masigi matungda Arimathea-dagi lakpa Joseph-na Pilate-ki maphamda chattuna Jisugi hakchang pibinaba haijarammi. (Joseph asi Jihudisingbu kibagi maramna lonna Jisugi tung-inba amani.) Pilate-na ayaba adu pibadagi mahakna hakchang adu pure. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1">Jn 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 3:2">2</ref></char></note>Nongma ahing amada Jisubu unaba chatluba Nicodemus-su mahakka loinarammi. Nicodemus-na myrrh amadi agor-ga yansinnaba manam nungsiba pot kilo kunthramarimuk puduna laklammi. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Makhoi anina Jisugi hakchang adu loure aduga Jihudisinggi chatnabigi matung inna manam nungsiba machalsingga loinana ananba limon phina yomsille. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Jisubu cross-ta hatkhiba mapham aduda ingkhol ama leirammi aduga ingkhol aduda mi kana amata phumdriba mongpham ama leirammi. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Jihudisinggi Potthabagi Thourang langbagi numit oibagi maram amadi mongpham adu manak nakna leibagi maramna Jisugi hakchang adu mongpham manung aduda thamle.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu hinggatpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mrk 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Chayolgi ahanba nummitki ayuk yamna ngallingei mamlingei matamda Mary Magdalene-na mongphamda lakpada mongpham changphamgi nung adu louthoklamba thengnare. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Mahakna Simon Peter amadi Jisuna nungsiba atoppa tung-inba adugi manakta chellaklaga makhoida hairak-i, “Makhoina Ibungobu mongphamdagi louthokkhre aduga makhoina Ibungobu kadaida thamkhrabano haiba eikhoi khangdre.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Adudagi Peter amadi atoppa tung-inba aduna mongpham tana chenkhirammi. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Makhoi ani chenminnei adubu atoppa tung-inba aduna Peter-gi mang thana chenkhatkhiduna mongphamda hanna thunglammi. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Mahakna nonthaduna yengbada mapham aduda ananba limon phi adu thamba urammi adubu mahak mongpham adugi manungdadi changlamde. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Madugi matungda mahakki tungda leihouba Simon Peter-su yourakle aduga Simon Peter-na mongpham manungda changlammi. Mapham aduda ananba limon-gi phi adu leiramba urammi <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>amadi Ibungogi kokthakta yetlamba phi adu thuplaga ananba limon phi adudagi tonganna leiramba thengnare. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Akonbada mongpham aduda hanna thungba Ibungogi tung-inba adusu mongpham manungda changlakle. Mahakna uraduna thajare. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>(Jisuna sibadagi hinggatpa tai haina Mapugi puyada i-ba adu houjik phaoba makhoina wakhal taba ngamlamdri.) <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Adudagi Ibungogi tung-inbasing adu makhoigi mayumda hankhre.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Mary Magdalene-da uhanbiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9">Mat 28:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mrk 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Mary-di mongpham adugi mapanda leplaga kaptuna leirammi. Mahakna kapna kapna luktharaga mongpham manungda yenglammi. <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>Maduda mahakna phingou setpa swargagi dut ani Ibungogi hakchang thamlamba mapham aduda phamduna leiba ure, amana lukhumda amana khuyada phamlammi. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Makhoina Mary-da hanglak-i, “Nupi, nahak karigi kaplibano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Maduda mahakna khumlak-i, “Makhoina eigi Ibungobu puthokkhre aduga makhoina Ibungobu kadaida thamkhrabano haiba ei khangdre.”<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Mary-na masi hek haibaga mahakna leithorakpada Jisuna mapham aduda leptuna leiramba adu mahakna ure adubu mahakna Jisuni haibadi khanglamde. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Jisuna mangonda hanglak-i, “Nupi, nahak karigi kaplibano? Nahak kanabu thiribano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Ibungobu ingkhol koiba mini haina Mary-na khanduna Ibungoda hairak-i, “Nahakna Ibungobu puthokkhiba oirabadi nahakna Ibungobu kadaida thambage haibadu eingonda takpiyu aduga eina Ibungobu louthokchage.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Mary!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Maduda mahakna Ibungolomda onsillaklaga Hebrew londa hairak-i, “Rabboni!” (Masigi wahanthokti “Oja” haibani.)<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Eingonda paiganu maramdi eihak houjik phaoba Ipagi maphamda kakhattri. Adubu nahakna eigi ichin inaosingda chattuna makhoida hairu, ‘Eina eigi Ipa Ibungo amadi nakhoigi Napa Ibungo aduga eigi Tengban Mapu amadi nakhoigi Tengban Mapu oiriba Ibungo mahakki manakta hallagani.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Maram aduna Mary Magdalene-na Ibungogi tung-inbasinggi manakta chattuna mahakna Ibungobu ujare haina tamle. Aduga Ibungona mangonda haibasing adusu makhoida tamle.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna mahakki tung-inbasingda uhanbiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mrk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Chayolgi ahanba numit adugi numidang wairamda Jihudisingbu kibadagi Ibungogi tung-inbasingna yumgi thong lonsillaga makhoi punna tinnaduna leirammi. Aduga khanghoudana Jisuna makhoigi marakta laktuna leplaga hairak-i, “Nakhoida ingthaba oisanu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Masi hairaba tungda Ibungona mahakki khut amadi puknop makhoida utlammi. Ibungogi tung-inbasingna Ibungobu ujabada haraobana thallammi. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoida ingthaba oisanu. Eigi Ipana eibu thaba adugumna einasu nakhoibu thari.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Madudagi Ibungona makhoida sor kamsinbiraga hairak-i, “Nakhoi Thawai Asengba phangjaro. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mat 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:18">18:18</ref></char></note>Nakhoina kanagumbagi pap kokpirabadi makhoigi pap adu kokpirabani; nakhoina kanagumbagi pap kokpidrabadi makhoigi pap adu kokpidrabani.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Thomas-ta uhanbiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Makhoi taranithoigi marakta ama oiriba Didymus hainasu kouba Thomas-ti Jisuna tung-inbasinggi manakta lakpa matamda mahak yaoramde. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Maram aduna Ibungogi tung-inbasingna mangonda hairak-i, “Eikhoina Ibungobu ujare!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Maduda Thomas-na makhoida khumlak-i, “Eina Ibungogi khutta taba yotpi makhul adu udriphaoba, eigi khudombina yotpi makhulsing aduda thamdriphaoba aduga eigi khutna Ibungogi puknopta thamdriphaoba keidoungeidasu thajaroi.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Chayol amagi matungda Ibungogi tung-inbasingna yum amada amuk punna leirammi maduda Thomas-su yaorammi. Yum adugi thong adu lonkhrabasu Jisuna laklaga makoigi marakta leptuna makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoida ingthaba oisanu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Madudagi Ibungona Thomas-ta hairak-i, “Nahakki khudombi adu mapham asida thammu aduga eigi khut ani asi yeng-u; nahakki khut adu tingthoktuna eigi puknopta thammu. Chingnaba thadok-u amasung thajou!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Maduda Thomas-na Ibungoda hairak-i, “Eigi Ibungo, eigi Tengban Mapu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Thomas nahakti eibu urabanina thajare adubu eibu udrabasu thajaba makhoi adu yaiphabani.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lairik asigi maram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Lairik asida isindaba atei angakpa thabak kaya amasu Jisuna mahakki tung-inbasinggi mamangda toukhi. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Adubu Jisudi Tengban Mapugi Machanupa Christta aduni haiba nakhoina thajananaba amadi Ibungo mangonda thajabagi mapanna nakhoina lomba naidaba hingba phangnanaba masising asi isinkhrabani.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna tung-inba taretta uhanbiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Masigi matungda Tiberias pat mapanda Jisuna mahakki tung-inbasingda amuk uhanbirammi. Masi asumna thokkhi. <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simon Peter, Didymus hainasu kouba Thomas, Galilee-gi Cana haiba maphamdagi Nathanael, Zebedee-gi machanupasing amadi atoppa Jisugi tung-inba ani hairiba makhoising asi punna leiminarammi. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:5">Luk 5:5</ref></char></note>Simon Peter-na makhoida hairak-i, “Ei nga phaba chatlage.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Maduda makhoina hairak-i, “Eikhoisu nahakka loinana chatke.” Maram aduna makhoina hi amada tongduna chatle adubu ahing chuppa makhoi kari amata phadre. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Ayuk anganbada Jisuna pat mapanda leptuna leirammi adubu Ibungogi tung-inbasing adunadi Ibungoni haiba khanglamde. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Adudagi Ibungona makhoida hairak-i, “Marupsing, nakhoi kari amata phadrabra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Maduda makhoina khumlak-i, “Kari amata phadre.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:6">Luk 5:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ibungona makhoida hairak-i, “In adu hi adugi yet thangba nakanda hullu, nakhoina nga kharadi phagani.” Maram aduna makhoina in adu hulle maduda nga yamna lakpadagi makhoina in adu chingkhatpa ngamdre.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Jisuna nungsiba tung-inba aduna Peter-da hairak-i, “Mahak Ibungoni!” Simon Peter-na Ibungoni haiba hek tabaga mahakna mahakki mapan thangba phi adu setchillaga patta chongtharammi (Maramdi mahak phi setlamde). <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Nga thanna yaoraba in adu atoppa Ibungogi tung-inbasing aduna hi amada tongduna pat mapan tanna chinglaklammi maramdi makhoi pat mapandagi lapna leiramde, chourakna khudup chanimukta lapna leirammi. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Makhoina kangphal youbada achakpa meitan mathakta nga thamba aduga tal khara leiba urammi. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoina houjik pharakpa nga khara purak-u.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Maduda Simon Peter-na hida kakhattuna nga achouba chama yangkheihumdoi yaoba in adu kangphalda chingkhatle. Nga yamna yaorabasu in adu segairamde. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Chararo lak-u.” Ibungogi tung-inba amatana “Nahak kanano?” haina hangba ngamlamde maramdi Ibungoni haiba makhoina khanglammi. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Adudagi Jisuna laktuna nga amadi tal adu louraga makhoida pirammi.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Jisuna sibadagi hinggatlaba matungda mahakki tung-inbasingda uhanbibasi masina ahumlak subani.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu amadi Peter</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Makhoina charaba matungda Jisuna Simon Peter-da hanglak-i, “John-gi machanupa Simon, makhoising asidagi henna nahakna eibu nungsibra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Simon Peter-na khumlak-i, “Hoi Ibungo, eina Ibungobu nungsi haibasi Ibungona khangbi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Eigi yaomachasingbu pijabiyu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Aniraksuba oina Jisuna hairak-i, “John-gi machanupa Simon, nahak eibu nungsibra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Simon Peter-na khumlak-i, “Hoi Ibungo, eina Ibungobu nungsi haibasi Ibungona khangbi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Eigi yaosingbu senbiyu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Ahumlaksuba oina Ibungona mangonda hanglak-i, “John-gi machanupa Simon, nahak eibu nungsibra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Jisuna mangonda “Nahak eibu nungsibra?” haina ahumlak suna hangba aduda mahak thamoi sokle. Maduda mahakna hairak-i, “Ibungo, Ibungona pumnamak khangbibani; eina Ibungobu nungsi haibasi Ibungona khangbi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Eigi yaosingbu pijabiyu. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Eina nangonda tasengnamak hairibasini, nahakna naha oiringeida nasana phiron setchei aduga nahakna chatningba maphamda chatlammi adubu nahakna ahal oiraba matamdadi nahakna nakhut tingthokkani aduga atoppa mi amana nahakpu phi setpigani aduga nahakna chatpa pamdaba maphamda nahakpu pugani.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>(Jisuna masi haibasi Peter-na karamba maongda siduna Tengban Mapubu matik mangal chaohan-gadage haibadu khang-hanbibani.) Adudagi Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Eigi itung illu.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu amadi Jisuna nungsiba tung-inba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:25">Jn 13:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Peter-na leithorakpada Jisuna nungsiba tung-inba aduna makhoigi tung illakpa adu urammi. Mahak asi numidang chaklen aduda Ibungogi manakta naksallaga “Ibungo, nahakpu pithokkadaba mahaktubu kanano?” haina hangkhiba tung-inba aduni. <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Peter-na mahakpu ubada Ibungoda hanglak-i, “Ibungo, mahakkidi kari oigadage?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Jisuna mangonda khumlak-i, “Eina laktri phaoba eina mahak hing-hanba pamlabadi maduda nangonda kari toubage? Nahak eigi itung illu.”<verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Masina maram oiraga tung-inba mahak asi siraroi haiba wapham Ibungogi tung-inbasinggi marakta sandoklammi. Adubu Jisuna mahak siroi haiba natte; “Eina laktri phaoba eina mahak hing-hanba pamlabadi maduda nangonda kari toubage?” haina Ibungona haibani.<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Tung-inba mahak adudi waramsing asi haiba amadi i-ba mahak asini. Mahakna haiba asi achumbani haiba eikhoina khang-i.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Waroisin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Jisuna touramba thabak mayam amasu leiri adubu makhoising adu amamam oina loina irabadi, igadaba lairiksing adu taibangpan asida thamba challoi haina eina khalli.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
